<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">- Ibaas</book>
  <para style="h">BaRoma</para>
  <para style="toc3">BaRo</para>
  <para style="toc2">BaRoma</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kufumung fɛ́ aBulus Jɛk sak na bafi ikuus na aRoma</para>
  <para style="mt1">BaRoma</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kufumung fɛ́ aBulus <optbreak /> Jɛk sak na bafi ikuus na aRoma</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1" />
  <para style="s">Ite ashow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1" />Kufumung kang ne ni bɔk aBulus, asam aYeso Kristi, fɛ́ ba ku yes na a sot atom aYeso, ba ku sak kyɛw nek ishara ifɛ̀ itek Adakunom. <verse eid="ROM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2" />Ifɛ̀ itek deng fɛ́ Adakunom ki mang cɛɛt neme nanu batan wu ni Fumung aJɛrɛ. <verse eid="ROM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3" />Ifɛ̀ itek e bi se azaton Arim wu, fi i ne ni irɔm, a kin ne ni izɔrɔk agwɔm aDauda, <verse eid="ROM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4" />awɛt nek kusot Kabik ajɛrɛ tɛ Adakunom iwu yet Arim Adakunom. Adakunom kin tonong anɔng e, ni kukyem wu ni izen idoro ifaben aYeso Kristi aTisa yit. <verse eid="ROM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5" />Ni bɔk aYeso wu fin kin di sɛ yit itek ni iyes in di sot yit batom aYeso, iyerek wu di sɛ iratek, in di sɛ in di sak Ícɛn-iduk ba di nesek atsak, nɛ ba di fok ifɛ̀ Adakunom, <verse eid="ROM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6" />ngma ni iyin fɛ́ ba mi ki yes yin ni i sot yin bafɛ́ aYeso Kristi. <verse eid="ROM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7" />Sak na ngma bayɔng fɛ́ ba se na aRoma, bayɔng fɛ́ Adakunom ka ba shim, fɛ́ ba ka ba yes batek. Won itek ni kusonong kukyang fi ku nes na Ada yit Adakunom nɛ aTisa yit aYeso Kristi ni ku bɛ́ ni yin.<verse eid="ROM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8" />Ni mɛsɛng e, in tsin nesek ifeng sak na Adakunom hom ni iyerek aYeso Kristi nek iyin ngma, nek kucɛɛt inɔɔk atsak yin mi kat kaakɛ na azatse. <verse eid="ROM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9" />Nek Adakunom fi in tsin ku ra kutomong ishara ifɛ̀ itekari wu, ni iyɛ hom ngma kusum, iwu fɛ́ a yet anet inɔɔk kanu ifɛ̀ naton hom fok, imi yiring ni iyin kaakyi izen, <verse eid="ROM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10" />in ras awon, ni in tɔ ye, ki i yet ishim Adakunom, won na a di tarak kawat, ni in bɛ́ azɔng ni yin yɔkɔnɔng.<verse eid="ROM 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11" />Nek imi bi iyɛ ingash ku di yin, nɔng in da ki te yin awɛng nnang fɛ́ kabik nesek <verse eid="ROM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12" />na anɔng, ngma yit in di ki sɛ yit agap, ayɛt inɔɔk atsak yit. <verse eid="ROM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13" />Ábaruneng, imi shim ni i rēn yin fok, in mi tsɛt kubɛ́ azɔng ni yin (awɛt in mi ni in sɛ kawat awo). In shim kubɛ́ me, nek in di bɛ́ na bakak ayɛt yin ni ikuus kpaf ti ishɛrɛp Ícɛn-iduk.<verse eid="ROM 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14" />Ba mi di nɔk kutomong sak nɛ bafi ilem aGirik nɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba yet ilem aGirik awo, sak na batsitsɛng nɛ áshɔp. <verse eid="ROM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15" />Nek anɔng wu, in di bi iyɛ ingash ishara ifɛ̀ itek ni yin fi i se yin na aRoma bà.<verse eid="ROM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16" />Nek imi fok nsum ishara ifɛ̀ itek awo, nek ide yet kukyem Adakunom fi ku nesek isheshek sak na kaangan fɛ́ a nɔɔk atsak, ba tun tumung ne baYahuda ni Ícɛn-iduk di kuus. <verse eid="ROM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17" />Nek ayɛt de fɛ́ ba di tonoso kusot kutabat fi ku nes na Adakunom, nek ba sɛs kusot kutabat e ni irèn inɔɔk atsak, nkum itumung e sak ni igang e, kyɔn ti i se ni ijɛk, &lt;&lt;Anet kusot kutabat, da sɛ kutset nek inɔɔk atsak wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18" />Nek ishɔt Adakunom mi tik azatse naton ngma bayɔng fɛ́ ba raba inye ikyɛng fɛ́ Adakunom shim nɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba raba ira atsak na ba nyɔ atsak ni nggɔn avit atsak bá. <verse eid="ROM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19" />Nek ikyɛng fi i se yɛɛt na ba rēn naton Adakunom, ba mi rēn ide, nek Adakunom mang ka ba tonong ide. <verse eid="ROM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20" />Nek kukyem Adakunom se vit nkum ni kusot Idakunom wu, nyɔng fɛ́ ayisi kyem a di awo. Awɛt neme ni itumung inye kazatse, ba mi tonong ina wɛshɛk, ba kyem ba rēn ina nek nkyɔrɔk fɛ́ ba kin nye ni itumung kazatse me. Nek anɔng, vit ayɔng fɛ́ a da kyem a ra nanan. <verse eid="ROM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21" />Ngma ni irēn Adakunom fɛ́ ba rēn, ba raba dang ku nesek iratek tɛ Adakunom kɛ na ba ku nesek ifeng ayi, aza anɔng, kuyiring ba se kpɛɛ, agadiring áyɛ bá te ngmalak. <verse eid="ROM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22" />Ba nye fok ba bɛ́ kutsitsɛng, awɛt ba yet áshɔp, <verse eid="ROM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23" />na ba shesheng izɔk fi i yet ifɛ́ Adakunom fɛ́ ashɔɔm sak ni nkyɔrɔk fi da in shɔɔm awo tɛ nanon ni nkyɔrɔk fi in tsees na atak ni nyɔng fi in kɔk nafa aben.<verse eid="ROM 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24" />Nek anɔng, Adakunom ka ba nabak sak ni kuduk kuyiring bá, sak ni iras nkyɔrɔk fi in se gbɛk-gbɛk, sak ni iras nkyɔrɔk nsum fi in beseng nrɔm bá, <verse eid="ROM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25" />nek ba mi tirik atsak Adakunom a sot mbɔɔs, ba ya ntong nɛ ba ra isam sak ni nkyɔrɔk fɛ́ ba nye aza Anet Inye me, iwu fɛ́ a kyem na ba ku tere ayɛ vit igang! Anɔng.<verse eid="ROM 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26" />Nek anɔng, Adakunom ka ba nabak ayɛt ifoos ikɔk nkyɔrɔk fi in tes ni nsum. Nek banyining bá monoso nrɔm ni kuri irèn ikak zɛɛt ni iyɔng fɛ́ Adakunom nye. <verse eid="ROM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27" />Kpaf anɔng bà, batek e raba inyis ne banyining, na ba tsɛsɛk bafidang ba bamatek ki ikɔk e ka ba daam. Bamatek nɛ bamatek ras nkyɔrɔk nsum, na anɔng fɛ́ ba di kok ice bá ishɔt fi i se kpaf ni kutomong anyas bá.<verse eid="ROM 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28" />Ayet nek iba raba irēn Adakunom na yɛ bá, Adakunom ka ba nabak ayɛt kuduk kuyiring bá tɛ áshɔp na ba ras ntomong fi in se gyat ira awo. <verse eid="ROM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29" />Nkum nggɔn bá ka sot nfɛ́ vit atsak kusum ni imaan e nɛ anyas nɛ nhwyɛ nɛ aduk nggɔn. Ba shining ni ifup ni ikok kutset ni kurēn ni mbɔɔs nɛ angmagalak áyɛ. Ba yet banet imonoso ncɛɛt, <verse eid="ROM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30" />bafi imɔɔt bakak, bafi iraye Adakunom, bafi itok, bafi ikok ice, bafi inesek ice bá iratek, bafi imonoso anyas, bafi ibyɛs batek. <verse eid="ROM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31" />Ba yet áshɔp, bafɛ́ avit atsak, vit iba ni ishim, vit iba ne angmishish. <verse eid="ROM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32" />Ngma ni irēn ishɔt Adakunom fɛ́ ba rēn fok anet fɛ́ a ras nggɔn yɔng, a kyem na ba sok kutset wu, ngma na anɔng, iba nyeseng ni iras e kyɛk awo, ba nesek irun ama na bayɔng fɛ́ ba ras ina.<verse eid="ROM 1:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2" />
  <para style="s">Ishɔt Adakunom se kpaf</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1" />Nek anɔng, ngɔn anet fi iyɛrɛ inɛn akak, vit ngɔn ni ihwyet, ki ni i yet angan ɛ. Nek izen fi i tsin ras bakak ishɔt, i tsin ras ice ngɔn e yɔng, nek ngɔn anet ishɔt e, i tsin ras nggɔn nzining e yɔng. <verse eid="ROM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2" />Iyit rēn yit fok ishɔt Adakunom se kpaf naton bayɔng fɛ́ ba ras nkyɔrɔk e nang. <verse eid="ROM 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3" />Ngɔn anet! Ngɔn di ti ngɔn fi i tsin ras bayɔng fɛ́ ba ras nkyɔrɔk e yɔng ishɔt, ni ngɔn tsin ras ina bà, ngɔn di ti i bi shorop ishɔt Adakunom ɛ? <verse eid="ROM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4" />Kì ngɔn byɛs kudot itek Adakunom nɛ akabɔk fɛ́ a nyes ni iyɛsɛp iyɛ fɛ́ a nye ni ngɔn ɛ? Kì ngɔn rēn fok itek fɛ́ Adakunom tonoso yet nek ngɔn di tirik sak ishan atsak awɛ?<verse eid="ROM 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5" />Awɛt nek kugbarak ice ngɔn ni kugbarak iyɛ fi ngɔn bɛ̀, ngɔn se ni itusung ice ngɔn ishɔt fi i tsin da tot, atuk fɛ́ Adakunom bi tonong kafa kawe wu, atuk e yɔng wu Adakunom bi bɛ́ a da tonong ishɔt wu fi i se tabat. <verse eid="ROM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6" />Nek Adakunom bi nɔɔk kaangan izang wu kpaf ni kutomong wu. <verse eid="ROM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7" />Sak na bayɔng fɛ́ ba se ni iras ntomong ntek ayɛt akabɔk, ba se ni itsɛt iratek ni itere ni kutset vit nkum, Adakunom bi ka ba nɔɔk kutset vit igang. <verse eid="ROM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8" />Awɛt bayɔng fɛ́ ba tsin tsɛsɛk ifi ice bá, bayɔng fɛ́ ba raba atsak, wɔn iras anyas, ba bi nyim ne kafa kawe ni mgbang Adakunom. <verse eid="ROM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9" />Izot ni mgbang tsin tot ngma banet fɛ́ ba ras anyas, ba bi tumung na baYahuda ni Ícɛn-iduk di kuus. <verse eid="ROM 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10" />Awɛt ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a ras ntomong ntek, a bi sɛ iratek ni ízɔk ni kusonong kukyang, ba bi tumung na baYahuda ni Ícɛn-iduk di kuus. <verse eid="ROM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11" />Nek Adakunom tonoso ishim ice awo.<verse eid="ROM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12" />Ngma bayɔng fɛ́ ba ras inɛn dang isɛ irēn ntsi aMusa, ba bi ka ba tabak dang ntsi aMusa, awɛt ngma bayɔng fɛ́ ba ras inɛn, iba ni irēn ntsi aMusa, ba bi ka ba ra ishɔt ni ntsi aMusa. <verse eid="ROM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13" />Kusot kutabat ashon Adakunom se na bayɔng fɛ́ ba ifoos ikyɛng fi Ntsi fɛ̀ kyɛk awo, tit na bayɔng fɛ́ ba ras ikyɛng fi Ntsi me fɛ̀, iba ba ba fɛ̀ tabat ashon Adakunom. <verse eid="ROM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14" />Nek ki Ícɛn-iduk fɛ́ ba se vit ntsi, ngma na anɔng ayɛt kuyiring bá, ba kyem ba ra ikyɛng fi ntsi fɛ̀, a sot ba rēn ntsi me ayɛt ayɛ bá, ngma ne avit ntsi bá. <verse eid="ROM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15" />Ba tonong fok ikyɛng fi ntsi fɛ̀ se ni ijɛk na ayɛ bá, kayɛt iyɛ bá run kama anɔng, ni kuyiring bá ka ba ras ishɔt. <verse eid="ROM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16" />Atuk e yɔng, kpaf ti ifɛ̀ itek deng fi in tsin shara me, Adakunom bi ra ishɔt nanu Anet-Isheshek aYeso naton nkyɔrɔk fi in se ni nɛt na ayɛ banet.<verse eid="ROM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17" />Awɛt ki ngɔn yes ice ngɔn, afɛ́ aYahuda, i nesek agap ni ntsi aMusa, ni tsot kukaa ayɛt ifidang na Adakunom, <verse eid="ROM 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18" />ni nye fok ngɔn rēn ikyɛng fi iwu shim, ngɔn rēn idɔng fi i se kpaf nek ntsi da tonong anɔng, <verse eid="ROM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19" />ngɔn bi inɔɔk atsak fok, ngɔn yet akɔk-ashon bakpatɔn, i yet mgbey sak na bafɛ́ ahwyi. <verse eid="ROM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20" />Anet itees bayɔng fɛ́ ba se vit itsɛ́ng, anet itees bayɔng fɛ́ ba bɛ̀ kuyiring nnon, nek ayɛt ntsi aMusa wu fi irēn nɛ atsak di se. <verse eid="ROM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21" />Wat ngɔn fi itees bakak, itees ice ngɔn bà awɛ? Ngɔn fi ishara fok, da ba bi yising awo, ngɔn yising awɛ? <verse eid="ROM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22" />Ngɔn fi i nye fok da ba bi ras kujang awo, ngɔn ras kujang awɛ? Ngɔn fi i rangɔn nabannom, ngɔn yising nkyɔrɔk iya ntong nabannom e awɛ? <verse eid="ROM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23" />Ngɔn fi itsot kukaa ni ntsi aMusa, ngɔn beseng Adakunom iyɛ fi ibeseng ntsi me awɛ? <verse eid="ROM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24" />Nek i se ni ijɛk, &lt;&lt;Nek iyin baYahuda, i mi sak yin Ícɛn-iduk mi beseng iyerek Adakunom.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25" />Iya katse se yɛɛt, ki i kuus yin ntsi aMusa, awɛt ki rayin dang kuus ntsi aMusa, i mi sot yin tɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba se vit iya katse. <verse eid="ROM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26" />Nek anɔng, ke anet fɛ́ da ba mi ku ya katse awo, a ras ikyɛng fi Ntsi fɛ̀, ba da ku sok tɛ ayɔng fɛ́ ba mi ku ya katse awɛ? <verse eid="ROM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27" />Nek anɔng, ayɔng fɛ́ ba mi ku ya katse awo, ngma na anɔng, na ras ikyɛng fi Ntsi fɛ̀, a bi da barak ni ishɔt, ngɔn ayɔng fi i bɛ̀ ntsi ni ijɛk, ba mi da ya katse, awɛt ni rangɔn dang ras ikyɛng fi ntsi me fɛ̀.<verse eid="ROM 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28" />Nek anet kyem a sot atitup afɛ́ aYahuda ni irɔm kɛ nek iya katse kyɛk awo, <verse eid="ROM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29" />Koba! Atitup anet aYahuda se ayɛt iyɛ, iya katse yet ifi iyɛ, fɛ́ Kabik ras, da ifi ijɛk awo. Itere anet e yɔng, nes na banet awo tit na Adakunom.<verse eid="ROM 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1" />Wat akyɛ de fi i yet itek e yɛ, ke anet sot afɛ́ aYahuda me yɛ? Kɛ akyɛ de fi i yet kugyat katse me yɛ? <verse eid="ROM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2" />Ey, na akaakyɛ irèn, ni imɛsɛng e, baYahuda ba Adakunom kin kaba nɔɔk ifɛ̀ atsak ni bɔk bá. <verse eid="ROM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3" />Awɛt, ke bakak ayɛt bá raba dang bereng ifɛ̀ me anɛ? Avit ibereng ifɛ̀ me, da sak Adakunom da won ikyɛng fɛ́ a mi tsang sak fok, a da nye yɛ? <verse eid="ROM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4" />Koba! Won Adakunom na a sot afɛ́ atsak, won kaangan na a sot afi mbɔɔs, ti i di se ni ijɛk, &lt;&lt;Nek ba di di katsak ngɔn ni icɛɛt, nɔng i di waat akaangan na atsak ni izen ishɔt.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5" />Awɛt ke avit atsak yit, tonoso kusot kutabat Adakunom wɛshɛk, akyɛ fi in da fɛ̀ yit ɛ? In da fɛ̀ yit fok Adakunom dun, ke a ki tabak yit ɛ? (In tsin cɛɛt tɛ anet awe.) <verse eid="ROM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6" />Koba! Ki ifi se anɔng, na anɛ wu fɛ́ Adakunom di ki ra kazatse ishɔt ɛ? <verse eid="ROM 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7" />Akak da kyem a fɛ̀ ane, &lt;&lt;Ki mbɔɔs hom da tun atsak Adakunom wɛshɛk, ni i ku barasa iratek wu, akyɛ sak fɛ́ ba rēn di ras ishɔt, tɛ anet inɛn ɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8" />Bakak ki tsɛk yit mbɔɔs fok iyit fɛ̀ yit ane, &lt;&lt;In da ya yit kashon na anyas, mok itek di ki bɛ́ yɛ?&gt;&gt; Ki i se anɔng, akyɛ ki rone ni in ya yit kashon ni iras anyas nɔng itek e di ki bɛ́s ɛ? Bayɔng fɛ́ ba nye ncɛɛt ibeseng yɔng, kyem na ba wey ni ba.<verse eid="ROM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vit anet atsak ko azining</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9" />In da gang yit ifɛ̀ me deng anɛ? Ke iyit baYahuda in wat yit ishɛrɛp banet ɛ? Koba! Iyit mi tsɛɛt yit ifɛ̀ fok, iyit baYahuda nɛ Ícɛn-iduk, ngma yit in se yit nawop inɛn. <verse eid="ROM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10" />I se ni ijɛk fok, &lt;&lt;Vit azining fɛ́ a yet afɛ́ kusot kutabat, vit kitsarang e. <verse eid="ROM 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11" />Vit akak fɛ́ a bi irēn, vit ayɔng fɛ́ a tsɛt Adakunom. <verse eid="ROM 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12" />Ngma ba ba mi nɔɔk Adakunom kama, ngma ba ba mi sot ahwye me. Vit azining ba fɛ̀ a nye ikyɛng itek, vit itsarang e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13" />&lt;&lt;Agbɔgbɔrɔ bá, se ti kurɛk fi ku se piyot, ba wɔrɔsɔ banet na alem bá.&gt;&gt; Alem bá turung nadɔm tɛ na fɛ ámazɛrɛ. <verse eid="ROM 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14" />&lt;&lt;Ánu bá shining ni itok nɛ amaan ifɛ̀.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15" />&lt;&lt;Atak bá se ziri ziri ni noos nasok; <verse eid="ROM 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16" />bà bɛ́ atak akan; <verse eid="ROM 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17" />ba rēn irèn kusonong kukyang awo.<verse eid="ROM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18" />&lt;&lt;Ba bi nnyim Adakunom na ayɛ bá awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19" />Yɔkɔnɔng in rēn yit fok ngma ikyɛng fi Ntsi fɛ̀, cɛɛt naton bayɔng fɛ́ ba se nawop ntsi, nɔng vit ayɔng fɛ́ a bi sɛ ikyɛng ifɛ̀, nɔng ngma kazatse bi nyeseng nanu ashon Adakunom nek ishɔt. <verse eid="ROM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20" />Nek vit anet fɛ́ a da kyem a sɛ ihwyet anu ashon Adakunom nek ntomong ntsi, i yet ntsi na fi in tonoso anet inɛn wu.<verse eid="ROM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusot kutabat anu ashon Adakunom mok inɔɔk atsak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21" />Awɛt yɔkɔnɔng, ba mi tun irèn ikak fɛ́ banet di ki sɛs ishashang ashon Adakunom, da ni irèn ntsi awo, kpaf tɛ ba kin di fɛ̀ ni ijɛk aMusa, ni ifɛ̀ batan ayame awo. <verse eid="ROM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22" />Kusot kutabat nes na Adakunom, ni irèn inɔɔk atsak na aYeso Kristi sak na bayɔng fɛ́ ba nɔɔk atsak. Nek iwu tonoso ishim ice awo, <verse eid="ROM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23" />nek kaangan mi ra inɛn, a mi gaat itsa sak ni imara ízɔk fɛ́ Adakunom nesek. <verse eid="ROM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24" />Wat Adakunom mi tonong itek kunang wu, in mi sot yit tabat anu ashon Adakunom, nek ibisik fɛ́ aYeso ki nye yit e. <verse eid="ROM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25" />Adakunom nabak aYeso na a sot kunang inabak ifuut anɛn, nek mok nasok wu, banet di sɛ ifuut anɛn bá nek inɔɔk atsak bá. Adakunom nye anɔng nek a di tonong kusot kutabat wu, nek ayɛt akabɔk wu a di wosong anɛn fɛ́ ba ki mang ra. <verse eid="ROM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26" />Adakunom kin nye anɔng ni izen e yɔng, nek a di tonong kusot kutabat wu, ama anɔng, a di tees bayɔng fɛ́ ba nesek atsak na aYeso ba di sot bafɛ́ kusot kutabat.<verse eid="ROM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27" />Awɛt naton akyɛ fi in di ki tsot yit kugwɔm ɛ? Vit ikikak! Ke ayet nek kutomong ntsi wu in di ki tsot yit kugwɔm ɛ? Awey! A yet nek atsak fi in nɔɔk yit na aYeso wu. <verse eid="ROM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28" />Nek iyit mi di yit, anet sɛs kusot kutabat ashon Adakunom nek inɔɔk atsak da nek iras ntomong ntsi awo. <verse eid="ROM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29" />Ke Adakunom yet Adakunom baYahuda kyɛk ɛ? A yet Adakunom Ícɛn-iduk bà awɛ? Ey, A yet afuba bà. <verse eid="ROM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30" />Nek Adakunom yet azining, iwu wu a bi kusu bayɔng fɛ́ bamang ka ba ya katse, ni irèn inɔɔk atsak, ngma nɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba se vit iya katse, ni irèn inɔɔk atsak bá. <verse eid="ROM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31" />I sot in da barak yit ntsi me, nek inesek atsak ɛ? Koba! In da bang te tsik yit ina ningya.<verse eid="ROM 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4" />
  <para style="s">Ba kusu AIbrahim nek inɔɔk atsak wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1" />Wɛt akyɛ fi in da fɛ̀ yit fok aIbrahim adakop yit ni irɔm ɛ? Kin rēn ayɛt icɛɛt kang ɛ? <verse eid="ROM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2" />Nek ki aIbrahim kin fɛ́ a sɛ kusot kutabat nek ntomong wu, ke a bi ikyɛng itsot kugwɔm, awɛt ki itsot kugwɔm wu me se ayɛt Adakunom awo, <verse eid="ROM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3" />nek ikyɛng de fi kufumung Adakunom fɛ̀ yɛ? &lt;&lt;AIbrahim kin nɔɔk atsak na Adakunom, nek anɔng, Adakunom ku te mo, i sot kusot kutabat ashon wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4" />Nek ikyɛng fɛ́ ba tarasa anet itomong, yet kunang awo, tit izang wu. <verse eid="ROM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5" />Awɛt ayɔng fɛ́ da ite iyɛ wu se naton kutomong wu awo, tit ni inɔɔk atsak na Adakunom, iwu yɔng fɛ́ a kanang bafi inɛn, ba fa inɔɔk atsak wu me, naton kusot kutabat nanu ashon Adakunom. <verse eid="ROM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6" />Ikyɛng de fɛ́ aDauda kin cɛɛt ni izen fɛ́ a kin fɛ̀, awɛng se gung ne anet yɔng fɛ́ Adakunom mi ki sok fok, a se tabat nanu ashon wu dang kutomong:<verse eid="ROM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7" />&lt;&lt;Awɛng se gung na bayɔng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:7">fɛ́ ba mi ku fuut anyas wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:7">ba mi ku kanang anɛn wu.<verse eid="ROM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8" />Awɛng se gung na anet yɔng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:8">fɛ́ da aTisa tɛ a fa anɛn wu awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9" />Asot fok awɛng e yong yet afɛ́ bayɔng fɛ́ ba mi ka ba ya katse kyɛk ɛ? Ke a yet ngma ne bayɔng fɛ́ ba se vit iya katse yɛ? Nek iyit mi fɛ̀ yit, Adakunom kin fa inɔɔk atsak aIbrahim naton kusot kutabat ashon wu. <verse eid="ROM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10" />Na akyi izen fi ikyɛng e deng kin te anɔng e yɛ? Na ba mi tsang ku ya katse me a? Ke na ba resek dang ku ya ne yɛ? Awey, ikyɛng e kin te na ba resek dang ku ya katse da ami ma me awo. <verse eid="ROM 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11" />Ba kin ne ba ku ya katse ami ma me, nɔng katse me bin sot ikyɛng idi kusot kutabat wu fɛ́ a kin sɛ iko nek inɔɔk atsak wu, neme dang na ba ku ya katse. Ba kin nye anɔng, mok a da sot ada bayɔng fɛ́ ba nesek atsak dang na ba ka ba ya katse, nɔng ba bin sot bafi kusot kutabat nanu ashon Adakunom bá, <verse eid="ROM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12" />nɔng aIbrahim a da tɛ a sot ada bayɔng fɛ́ ba mi ka ba ya katse, da nek iya katse me kyɛk awo, tit nek ikuus atak inɔɔk atsak fɛ́ ada yit aIbrahim kin nye neme dang na ba ku ya katse.<verse eid="ROM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">A sɛ ikyɛng fɛ́ ba kin fɛ̀ ba da nye me nek inɔɔk atsak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13" />Nek kushii fɛ́ ba kin nye aIbrahim ni izit wu ne ye, a bi iya itekari azatse, anɔng e kin te nek iwu shining ntsi awo, tit nek kusot kutabat fi iwu kin sɛ ni irèn inɔɔk atsak. <verse eid="ROM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14" />Nek i kin fi i yet fok bafi ishinishi ntsi ba fɛ̀ ba iya itekari azatse, ki inɔɔk atsak, sot abap, ni ikyɛng fɛ́ Adakunom kin kushii me, sot vit ice me. <verse eid="ROM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15" />Nek ntsi sas naman Adakunom na na tik, awɛt karɔ fi ntsi se vit, ibeseng ntsi se narɔ me yɔng awo.<verse eid="ROM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16" />Nek anɔng, kushii me kin ne ni inɔɔk atsak, nɔng itek e da bin sot atitup kunang fɛ́ Adakunom nɔɔk bafi izit aIbrahim ngma kusum, da nkum bayɔng fɛ́ ba berese ntsi kyɛk awo, tit ngma ne bayɔng fɛ́ ba di kuus atak inɔɔk atsak aIbrahim bà. Iwu fɛ́ a yet ada yit ngma. <verse eid="ROM 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17" />I se ni ijɛk ye, &lt;&lt;Imi mi da sak ni i sot ada icɛ́n azatse dot.&gt;&gt; Iwu yet ada yit nanu ashon Adakunom, ni wu fɛ́ a di nɔɔk atsak. Adakunom fɛ́ a nesek kutset sak ni nkom, na tɛ na sas nkyɔrɔk fi in se vit, ni in sot.<verse eid="ROM 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18" />Ngma ni kuri ndaam fi in kin te aIbrahim nate, a ya kashon ni inesek atsak na Adakunom, ni ite iyɛ fok iwu da sot ada icɛ́n dot. Nek Adakunom man fɛ̀ ni iwu ye, &lt;&lt;Izit ngɔn bi se ane.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19" />AIbrahim kin se bakat ayɛ anakat azining, ngma ni ikop fi i mi ku ya ti kukom, ni ikumung fɛ́ abining wu aSara bɛ̀, ngma na anɔng, inɔɔk atsak wu te gbɛrɛk awo. <verse eid="ROM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20" />Awɛt aIbrahim won ikikak i ku tegak iyɛ ni inɔɔk atsak wu, azaton ikyɛng fɛ́ Adakunom mi fɛ̀ a da ku nye ne awo, awɛt inɔɔk atsak wu ban te agap, na tere ízɔk Adakunom, <verse eid="ROM 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21" />ni ite iyɛ fok Adakunom kyem fɛ́ a da shining ifɛ̀ wu. <verse eid="ROM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22" />Nek anɔng wu fi inɔɔk atsak wu sak, &lt;&lt;Ba ku fa iye i sot, kusot kutabat nanu ashon Adakunom.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23" />Awɛt ikyɛng fɛ́ ba kin jɛk e yet nek iwu aziwu kyɛk awo, <verse eid="ROM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24" />tit sak ni yit ngma yit fi in nɔɔk yit atsak na ayɔng fɛ́ a dorok aYeso aTisa yit, ni irɛk. <verse eid="ROM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25" />AYeso yɔng fɛ́ ba kin ku nabak, a ku nek anɛn yit, ba tɛ ba ku donong ni kutset nek kusot kutabat yit ashon Adakunom.<verse eid="ROM 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5" />
  <para style="s">Kukyang ni ifeng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1" />Yɔkɔnɔng fi in bɛ́ yit kusot kutabat ashon Adakunom nek inɔɔk atsak, in mi sɛ yit kusot kukyang ne Adakunom fi ku ne na aTisa yit aYeso Kristi. <verse eid="ROM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2" />Ni wu fi in mi sɛ yit kunɔ ayit itek fi in di se yit yɔkɔnɔng, nek inɔɔk atsak yit. In bɛ̀ yit ifeng ni ite iyɛ imoon mbɔk iyit ízɔk Adakunom. <verse eid="ROM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3" />Da idɔng kyɛk awo, in bɛ́ yit iyɛ ikan ayit mgbang yit, nek in rēn yit fok mgbang bes ne anyɛk, <verse eid="ROM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4" />nɛ anyɛk bes ni nggɔn ntek, ni nggɔn ntek nesek ite iyɛ na Adakunom. <verse eid="ROM 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5" />Ni ite iyɛ yit ki tes yit nsum awo, nek Adakunom mi ki korok yit ishim wu na ayɛ yit ni irèn Kabik aJɛrɛ fɛ́ ba mi ki nɔɔk yit.<verse eid="ROM 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6" />Na kpaf izen, ni iyit rēn resek yit mo vit agap, Anet-Isheshek ku mok iyit fi in yet bafi inɛn. <verse eid="ROM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7" />Nek i bi mgbang akak na a ku nek anet kusot kutabat. Awɛt nyen akak da kyem a nye iyɛ na aku nek anet fɛ́ a bɛ̀ nggɔn ntek. <verse eid="ROM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8" />Awɛt Adakunom ki tonong yit ishim wu, ni iyit ren resek yit mo bafi inɛn, aKristi ku mok iyit. <verse eid="ROM 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9" />Ki inosong nasok Anet-Isheshek mi ki bɛ́ yit ni kusot kutabat nanu ashon Adakunom, wat a bi ne a won dang ki sheshek yit na naman Adakunom ɛ? <verse eid="ROM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10" />Nek ki izen fi in ren se yit ifa ne Adakunom, in sɛ yit kusot inosong-ashi nek iku ari wu, wat yɔkɔnɔng fi in mi nosong ashi, a da won dang ki sheshek ni kutset wu ɛ? <verse eid="ROM 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11" />Kashon na anɔng, in bɛ̀ yit iyɛ ikan ne Adakunom nek aTisa yit aYeso Kristi, iwu fɛ́ a bɛ́ ni inosong-ashi yit.<verse eid="ROM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iku ne na Adamu <optbreak /> kutset ne na AKristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12" />Nek anɔng, kpaf ti fi inɛn di nɔ azatse na anet azining, iku di kuus kama inɛn, na anɔng wu iku se na banet ngma kusum nek kaangan man nye inɛn, <verse eid="ROM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13" />nek inɛn kin se azatse neme dang na ba nɔɔk ntsi, awɛt ba kyem ba fa inɛn narɔ fɛ́ da ntsi di se awo. <verse eid="ROM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14" />Ngma na anɔng, ikyɛng fi iyit izen Adamu sak ni izen aMusa iku ya igwɔm naton banet, ngma na bayɔng fi inɛn ba yet kuri nfi ibeseng ntsi tɛ Adamu awo. Adamu sot tɛ nawu ayɔng fɛ́ a da bɛ́.<verse eid="ROM 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15" />Awɛt kunang fɛ́ Adakunom mi nɔɔk na ayɔng fɛ́ a bi bɛ́ me, ku se zɛɛt ni inɛn fi i kin ne na Adamu. Di yin fi inɛn anet azining bɛ́ ni iku na banet dot. Ngma na anɔng itek Adakunom wat, ngma ni kunang fi ku ne na anet azining aYeso Kristi fi ku ki bɛ́ yit mo na agbat awɛng. <verse eid="ROM 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16" />Nek, kunang Adakunom se ki ikyɛng fi inɛn anet azining bene awo. Ishɔt e bɛ nek inɛn izining, i bɛ́ ni iku, awɛt kunang Adakunom fi ku ne ama anɛn zizɛɛt, bɛ́ ni ikusu ashon Adakunom. <verse eid="ROM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17" />Ke nek inɛn anet azining, iku ya igwɔm naton banet nek anet azining e yɔng, bayɔng fɛ́ ba mi sɛ kunang itek, ni kusot kutabat, ba da ya igwɔm makiyi nek anet azining e yɔng fɛ́ a yet aYeso Kristi.<verse eid="ROM 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18" />Nek anɔng, kpaf ti fi inɛn anet azining bɛ́ ni ishɔt iku banet ngma kusum, kpaf anɔng fi kutomong kutabat fɛ́ anet azining nye bɛ́ ni kusot kutabat ni kutset sak na banet ngma. <verse eid="ROM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19" />Kpaf ti fi avit ifok-ifɛ́ anet azining tirik banet ngma ba sot bafi inɛn, anɔng wu fi ifok-ifɛ́ anet azining da tirik banet dot di sot bafi kusot kutabat ashon Adakunom. <verse eid="ROM 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20" />Ba bɛ́ ni ntsi nɔng anɛn bin bang di wuru, awɛt karɔ fi inɛn di ya kashon, azɔng wu Adakunom bang di barasa itek wu, <verse eid="ROM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21" />nɔng kpaf ti fi inɛn kin ya igwɔm ni kubɛ́ iku, anɔng wu fi itek Adakunom da ya igwɔm ayit kusot kutabat ni kutset vit nkum fɛ́ aTisa yit aYeso Kristi nesek.<verse eid="ROM 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6" />
  <para style="s">In ku yit na anɛn <optbreak /> batset na Anet-Isheshek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1" />Akyɛ fi in da fɛ̀ yit kong ɛ? In da ya yit kashon ni iras anɛn, nɔng Adakunom da ki tonong yit mo itek wu yɛ? <verse eid="ROM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2" />Ko ni kuro! Na anɛ fi iyit fi in mi kus yit na anɛn yit, da ti in sot yit bafi ira me yɛ? <verse eid="ROM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3" />Iyin rēn yin fok ngma yit fɛ́ ba kin man ki ra yit abatisma na Anet-Isheshek aYeso, ba mi ki ra yit abatisma sak ni iku wu awɛ? <verse eid="ROM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4" />Nek anɔng, ba mi ki nɛt yit gung ni iwu na abatisma, in mi sot yit bazining ni iku wu, nek kyɔn tɛ ba kin di donong na Anet-Isheshek ni iku, ayɛt ízɔk Ada Adakunom, anɔng fi iyit da nye yit kusot ayɛt kutset kufas.<verse eid="ROM 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5" />Nek ki in mi sot yit bazining ni iwu ni iku wu, i se gbing-gbing in bi sɛ yit idoro ifaben ni iwu. <verse eid="ROM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6" />Nek iyit rēn yit fok, ba kin tekak anet azen yit gung ni iwu, nɔng ba bin di fɛt nggɔn anɛn irɔm yit, nɔng da in bi ti in sot yit basam inɛn awo. <verse eid="ROM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7" />Nek ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a kin man ku, ba man ku bisik nawop inɛn yɔng.<verse eid="ROM 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8" />Yɔkɔnɔng fi in mi ku yit na Anet-Isheshek, in bɛ̀ yit inɔɔk atsak fok, in bi sot yit gung ni iwu. <verse eid="ROM 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9" />Nek in rēn yit fok ye, ba mi donong Anet-Isheshek ni irɛk, a da tɛ a ku kong awo, iku ti i bɛ̀ ice naton wu kong awo. <verse eid="ROM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10" />Nek iku fɛ́ a ku, a ku kazining pɛɛt nek bafi inɛn ngma kusum, awɛt kutset fɛ́ a se ne, a se ne nek Adakunom.<verse eid="ROM 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11" />Kpaf anɔng, fa yin ace yin tɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba mi kus na anɛn bá, awɛt ba yet batset na Adakunom nek kusot fɛ́ ba se ne ayɛt Anet-Isheshek aYeso. <verse eid="ROM 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12" />Nek anɔng, i bi won yin inɛn ni i ya igwɔm ayɛt nrɔm yin fi in kus awo, ni inɛn e ki sas yin ni ras yin nggɔn ishim nrɔm yin. <verse eid="ROM 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13" />Da i bi nasap yin nkap nrɔm yin ni iras inɛn awo, ni in sot ares itomong anyas awo, tit ni nasap yin ace yin na Adakunom, tɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba mi ka ba tirik ni iku sak ni isɛ kutset. Nasap yin nkap nrɔm yin na Adakunom, tɛ ares ntomong ntek. <verse eid="ROM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14" />Nek inɛn da ti i sot atekari yin awo, nek da i ti se yin na ngamang ntsi awo, tit na ngamang itek Adakunom.<verse eid="ROM 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Basam sak nse kusot kutabat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15" />Akyɛ fi in da fɛ̀ yit ɛ? In da ras yit inɛn nek da in se yit na ngamang ntsi awɛ? Kɛ nek in se yit na ngamang itek Adakunom ɛ? Kaa, awey yo! <verse eid="ROM 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16" />Iyin rēn yin fok ngma ayɔng fi i ku nabak yin ace yin na awop wu, ni foos yin ifɛ̀ wu tɛ basam, i mi sot yin basam, ayɔng fi i ku foos yin e awɛ? Ke ni sot yin basam sak ni inɛn, fi ibɛ́s ni iku, kɛ ni i sot yin basam ni ifoos ifɛ̀ Adakunom, fi ibɛ́s ni kusot kutabat. <verse eid="ROM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17" />Won ifeng ni i sot ifɛ́ Adakunom, nek ngma fi i tsang yet yin basam inɛn yame, awɛt yɔkɔnɔng i mi sot yin bafi ifoos ifɛ̀ Adakunom na ayɛ yin ngma kusum naton nkyɔrɔk fɛ́ ba mi ki tees yin ina. <verse eid="ROM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18" />Ba mi ki bisik yin washak ni inɛn, i mi sot yin basam kusot kutabat.<verse eid="ROM 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19" />In tsin cɛɛt ni yin ni irèn fɛ́ banet mi di mɛɛ, nek nggɔn anet awe in yet nfi kurat. Kyɔn ti fi i mi di mɛɛ yin ni nasap yin nkap nrɔm yin ni iras ntomong isam ngbɛk-gbɛk nɛ ntomong iboroso anyas, won yɔkɔnɔng nasap yin ina ni in sot nfi isam kusot kutabat fi ku bɛ́s ni kusot ajɛrɛ. <verse eid="ROM 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20" />Ni izen fi i kin yet yin basam inɛn, kusot kutabat kin bɛ̀ ice azaton yin awo. <verse eid="ROM 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21" />Awɛt akyɛ itek fi i kin di sɛ yin ni nkyɔrɔk nang fi in mi sot ikyɛng nsum ni yin ɛ? Nkum nkyɔrɔk e yɔng, yet iku. <verse eid="ROM 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22" />Awɛt yɔkɔnɔng fɛ́ ba mi ki bisik yin washak ni bɔk inɛn, i mi sot yin basam Adakunom, itek fi i mi sɛ yin, yet kusot ajɛrɛ, fi nkum ko yet kutset vit igang. <verse eid="ROM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23" />Nek itarang inɛn yet iku, awɛt kunang Adakunom yet kutset vit nkum ayɛt Anet-Isheshek aYeso, aTisa yit.<verse eid="ROM 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7" />
  <para style="s">Ibisik ni ntsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1" />Ábaruneng, in tsin cɛɛt ni iyin tɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba rēn ntsi, nek iyin rēn yin fok ntsi ya naton anet fɛ́ a yet atset kyɛk awɛ? <verse eid="ROM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2" />Kpaf tɛ ane, ntsi iweneng, in rosom abin iweneng na amatek wu, ni izen fɛ́ amatek wu se ni kutset kyɛk, awɛt ke amatek wu me a ku, ba mi ku bisik ni ntsi iweneng e yɔng. <verse eid="ROM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3" />Nek anɔng wu, ke a tɛ a ra kuweneng ne anet akak, i sot ba da ku yes afi irɔs, ke amatek wu me rēn resek mo ni kutset. Awɛt ke amatek wu me mi ku, a sot ba mi ku bisik ni ntsi kuweneng e yɔng, ke a tse a bɔ amatek akak, da i ti yet irɔs kong awo.<verse eid="ROM 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4" />Idɔng kpaf anɔng ábaruneng, iku Anet-Isheshek naton kukum itekak, mi ki sak yin i mi kus yin ni ikuus ntsi, nɔng i da bin sot yin bafɛ́ akak, iwu ayɔng fɛ́ ba mi ku donong ni iku, nɔng i da bin nye yit kusot fi ku da nɔɔk Adakunom iratek. <verse eid="ROM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5" />Nek ni izen fi in rēn kuus yit ikɔk ishim irɔm yit, ntsi me ki barasa yit mo ikɔk iras inɛn ni nrɔm yit, nɔng ngma nkyɔrɔk fi in ras yit ina, in da tse ni yit ni iku. <verse eid="ROM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6" />Awɛt yɔkɔnɔng fi mi kus yit, ni nkyɔrɔk yɔng fi i ki rosom yit, ba mi ki bisik yit ni ntsi me, nɔng in da bin ra yit kutomong ni irèn ifas ifɛ́ Kabik, da ni in tin tsees yit ni irèn izen ifi ntsi fi in se ni ijɛk e me awo.<verse eid="ROM 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibɔrɔng ni inɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7" />Akyɛ fi in da fɛ̀ yit kong ɛ? Ntsi me yet inɛn ɛ? Koba! Afɛ́ yet ke da nek ntsi me awo, ki imi rēn ikyɛng fi i yet inɛn awo. Ke da nek ntsi me awo, ki imi rēn ikyɛng fɛ́ ba yes ide kuhwye awo, ina fɛ̀ ye, &lt;&lt;Da i bi te kuhwye ni ikyɛng akak awo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8" />Awɛt inɛn, i sɛ kawat nek ntsi me, i di tes mo kuhwye ndiri-ndiri me. Nek ke da ni ntsi me awo, inɛn mi te kukom me. <verse eid="ROM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9" />Yame fi ntsi kin di se awo, in yet atset dang ina. Awɛt izen fi ntsi bɛ́, in shemeng inɛn, in wat in ku. <verse eid="ROM 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10" />In da ni in di kong fok, ina ntsi me yɔng fɛ́ ba yes nyan in da bɛ́ ni kutset, in da ni in bɛ́ ni iku.<verse eid="ROM 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11" />Nek inɛn sɛ kawat nek ntsi me, i di wɔrɔk, ni irèn ntsi me, in di fɛt mo. <verse eid="ROM 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12" />Nek anɔng e kong, ntsi me se jɛrɛ, ata-ifɛ̀ me se jɛrɛ, in se tabat, in se gyat. <verse eid="ROM 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13" />Sɛɛ in da fɛ̀ fok, ikyɛng fi i yet itek e me de i di bɛ́ ni iku yɛ? Koba! Awɛt nɔng ba bin rēn fok inɛn yet inɛn, i di bɛ́ ni iku ni irèn ikyɛng fi i kin yet itek, nɔng ni irèn ata-ifɛ̀ me, in da bin di yit gbɛngɛrɛng fok inɛn yet aduk ikyɛng.<verse eid="ROM 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14" />Iyit rēn yit fok ntsi me ne na kabik Adakunom, awɛt imi yet anet awe kyɛk, fɛ́ a yet asam ni bɔk inɛn. <verse eid="ROM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15" />Imi rēn ikyɛng fi in di se ne awo. Nek ikyɛng fi in shim in ra ide, da ide de fi in ra awo, awɛt ikyɛng fi imi ramin ide zak-zak, ide me dɔng in ras. <verse eid="ROM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16" />Ki imi ras ikyɛng fi da in shim irade awo, idɔng sot fok in mi fɛ̀ ey, ntsi me yet ntek. <verse eid="ROM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17" />Awɛt yɔkɔnɔng, da a tɛ a yet imi ice hom wu fi in ras nkyɔrɔk e me yɔng awo, tit inɛn fi i sot ayɛt iyɛ hom de. <verse eid="ROM 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18" />Nek in rēn fok vit ikyɛng itek fi i se ayɛt hom, ayet nggɔn anet awe. Nek in bi iyɛ ingash inye ikyɛng itek akabɛs, awɛt in ni in kyem ira me awo. <verse eid="ROM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19" />Nek ikyɛng fi in nye, da i yet ikyɛng itek fi in shim in nye awo, awey, tit imaan e me dɔng fi in shim i nye ide awo, ide me dɔng in di ban iras e. <verse eid="ROM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20" />Yɔkɔnɔng, ki in ras ikyɛng fi da in shim ira me awo, idɔng tonong fok, da imi wu in ras ide awo, tit inɛn fi i se ni kusot ayɛt hom de fi iras iko.<verse eid="ROM 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21" />Nek in mi di ane: Izen fi in shim in nye ikyɛng itek, ni imaan e ma sot pang ni imi. <verse eid="ROM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22" />Nek tsik ayɛt iyɛ hom, iyɛ hom tɛrɛk ni ntsi Adakunom, <verse eid="ROM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23" />awɛt i ni in di ntsi nkak fi in se ni kutomong ni nkap irɔm min, fi in se ni itang itsom ni ntsi abik hom. In di sas ni in sot asam inɛn, fi i se ni kutomong ayɛt nkap irɔm hom. <verse eid="ROM 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24" />Ye kukuu! In mi sot ikyɛng angmishish! Angan di ki sheshek ni kurɔm kang fi ku di ki tsa sak ni iku yɛ? <verse eid="ROM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25" />Itere ni i sot ifɛ́ Adakunom fɛ́ a di sheshek ni irèn aYeso Kristi aTisa yit.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 7:25">Na anɔng, imi ice hom ayɛt iyɛ hom, in yet asam ni ntsi Adakunom, awɛt ayɛt nggɔn anɛn irɔm, in yet asam ni ntsi inɛn.<verse eid="ROM 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8" />
  <para style="s">Kutset fi ku nes na Abik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1" />Nek anɔng, yɔkɔnɔng vit ishɔt fi i kyɛk naton bayɔng fɛ́ ba se ayɛt Anet-Isheshek aYeso. <verse eid="ROM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2" />Nek ni irèn aKristi Yeso, ntsi Kabik fi in nesek kutset, in mi ki bisik washak ni bɔk ntsi inɛn fi in bɛ́s ni iku. <verse eid="ROM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3" />Nek ikyɛng fi ntsi me kyɛm in nye awo nek kurat nggɔn anet awe, ide de Adakunom kyɛm a nye. Adakunom tom azizɛɛt ari wu ni nse banet inɛn, nek na a sot nabak-akuce ikanang anɛn. Na anɔng wu fɛ́ a di tsɛɛt inɛn ishɔk iku ni nse anet awe, <verse eid="ROM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4" />Adakunom nye anɔng e nɔng ngma nkyɔrɔk ntabat fi ntsi me fɛ̀, bin se ishining ayɛt yit, iyit bayɔng fɛ́ da in kuus yit nse anet awe awo, tit nse abik.<verse eid="ROM 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5" />Nek bayɔng fɛ́ ba se kusot ni nse anet awe, ba tes iyɛ bá ni nkyɔrɔk fi nse me shim, awɛt bayɔng fɛ́ ba se kusot ayɛt abik, ba tes iyɛ bá ni nkyɔrɔk abik. <verse eid="ROM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6" />Nek kuyiring nse anet inɛn bes ni iku, awɛt kuyiring nse abik, bes ni kusot kukyang. <verse eid="ROM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7" />Nek kuyiring anet inɛn, yet ifa na Adakunom. I fok itabak ntsi Adakunom awo, kɛ ni nye ide ayi. <verse eid="ROM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8" />Bayɔng fɛ́ nse anet awe na in ka ba kɔk kutaa, bayɔng da kyem ba nye Adakunom iyɛ awo.<verse eid="ROM 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9" />Awɛt iyin, da nse anet awe na in ki kɔk yin awo, tit Kabik ka ka ki kɔk yin, nek Kabik Adakunom se ayɛt yin. Awɛt ngma ayɔng fɛ́ da Kabik Anet-Isheshek se ayɛt wu awo, ayɔng e yet afuu awo. <verse eid="ROM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10" />Awɛt ke Anet-Isheshek se ayɛt yin, nrɔm yin bi kus nek inɛn, ngma na anɔng kabik yin yet atset nek kusot kutabat yin ashon Adakunom. <verse eid="ROM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11" />Ke Kabik ayɔng fɛ́ a donong aYeso ni irɛk se ni kusot ayɛt yin, iwu yɔng fɛ́ a donong Anet-Isheshek ni irɛk e, bi nɔɔk nrɔm yin fi in kus kutset fi ku nes na abik wu, iwu yɔng fɛ́ a se kusot ayɛt yin.<verse eid="ROM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12" />Nek anɔng ábaruneng, in bɛ̀ yit kutomong ira, da ni ras yit ishim irɔm awo. <verse eid="ROM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13" />Nek ki i nye yin kusot ni nse inɛn, i da kus yin, awɛt ki i nye yin kusot abik, i da sak yin aduk ntomong nrɔm da kus, ni iyin sot yin ni kutset. <verse eid="ROM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14" />Nek bayɔng fɛ́ Kabik Adakunom ka ba kɔk kutaa, iba ba, ba yet nnon Adakunom. <verse eid="ROM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15" />Nek da iyin shan yin kabik isam fɛ́ ka bɛ́s ni inyim awo, tit Kabik nggon ari. Kabik e ki nesek yit agap iye in di yes yit Adakunom, &lt;&lt;Abba!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni ilem Aramik </char><char style="fq">Abba</char>: yet <char style="fqa" closed="false">Ada.</char></note> Ada hom!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16" />Kabik Adakunom ice wu, gung na kabik kafiit, ki taas yit fok, iyit yet yit nnon Adakunom. <verse eid="ROM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17" />Yɔkɔnɔng fi in yet yit nnon, in mi sot yit bafi iya itekari Adakunom. In da ya yit itekari me gung na Anet-Isheshek, ki in sɔ yit izot gung ni iwu, anɔng e da sak in bi sɔ yit nta gung ni iwu bà.<verse eid="ROM 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ízɔk fi i se ashon yit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18" />Nek imi mi di fok, izot fi in tsin sɔ yit yɔkɔnɔng, ba da kyem ba mara ide ni ízɔk fɛ́ ba bi ki tonong yit ashon awo. <verse eid="ROM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19" />Nek ngma nkyɔrɔk fɛ́ Adakunom nye, in bi iyɛ ingash makiyi nek ku di izen fɛ́ Adakunom bi tonong nnon wu. <verse eid="ROM 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20" />Nek nkyɔrɔk fɛ́ ba nye me in sɛ ice na ni firik, da iyet ikasa de awo. Awɛt i te anɔng ni kushim ayɔng fɛ́ a nyɔrɔk ite iyɛ na me <verse eid="ROM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21" />fok atukak ba bi bisik nkyɔrɔk fɛ́ Adakunom nye me ni isam ibush, in bi sɛ nta ntek fɛ́ ba bi nɔɔk nnon Adakunom.<verse eid="ROM 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22" />Nek iyit rēn yit, sak atut ana, ngma nkyɔrɔk fɛ́ ba nye, in tsin rus ni mgbang tɛ abin-ites. <verse eid="ROM 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23" />Da nkyɔrɔk fɛ́ ba nye me kyɛk awo, ngma ni iyit, in tsin rus yit, iyit fɛ́ Kabik mi ki nɔɔk yit kunang imɛsɛng, in se ni itot yit ni iyɛ ngash izen fɛ́ Adakunom bi ki sok yit ti nnon wu, na ma bisik nrɔm yit washak. <verse eid="ROM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24" />Ayet nek ite iyɛ yeng ye fɛ́ ba ki sheshek yit mo. Awɛt ite iyɛ ni ikyɛng fɛ́ ba mi di, iyet ite iyɛ awo. Angan tɛ a di te iyɛ ni ikyɛng fɛ́ a mi tsang di yɛ? <verse eid="ROM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25" />Awɛt ki ite iyɛ yit se naton ikyɛng fi in resek yit dang sɛ yit, in da tot yit ide ayɛt akabɔk.<verse eid="ROM 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26" />Kpaf anɔng wu fɛ́ Kabik e ki sɛs yit mo ayɛt avit agap yit. Nek da iyit rēn yit irèn fi in di ki ra yit awon awo, tit Kabik ka ice ka, ka ras awon akuce yit ni irus vit kucɛɛt. <verse eid="ROM 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27" />Iwu Adakunom fɛ́ a yɛrɛ kutsik ayɛ yit, a rēn ngma kutɔrɔng Kabik, nek Kabik e ras awon akuce bafɛ́ ajɛrɛ kpaf ni kushim Adakunom.<verse eid="ROM 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">In waat yit agap bayɔng fɛ́ ba ya mben</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28" />Iyit rēn yit fok ayɛt akaakyi ikyɛng, Adakunom nyes ikyɛng itek nek bayɔng fɛ́ ba kushim, bayɔng fɛ́ ba mi ka ba yes kpaf ni ite iyɛ wu. <verse eid="ROM 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29" />Nek bayɔng fɛ́ Adakunom mi rēn, a tɛ kasa iba nɔng ba bin tas ari wu, nɔng iwu bin sot kutes ashon ayɛt baruneng wu dot. <verse eid="ROM 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30" />Bayɔng fi iwu mi myak me, a tɛ a ka ba yes, bayɔng fi iwu mi ka ba yes e, ishɔt iwu mi ka ba sak kutabat, bayɔng fɛ́ ba mi ka ba sak tabat e, a ka ba te iratek.<verse eid="ROM 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31" />Akyɛ fi in da fɛ̀ yit naton ikyɛng deng ɛ? Ke Adakunom se abak yit, angan da kyem a ra ifa ni iyit ɛ? <verse eid="ROM 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32" />Iwu fɛ́ da a rone ari wu awo, awɛt a nabak ari wu me nek iyit ngma, a da won dang ki nɔɔk yit kaakyi ikyɛng ni kubɔk washak ɛ? <verse eid="ROM 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33" />Angan da kyem a te kukun bayɔng fɛ́ Adakunom mi myak yɛ? Adakunom wu fɛ́ a sak banet sot tabat. <verse eid="ROM 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34" />Angan da kyem a ka ba tsɛɛt ishɔt iku yɛ? Nek Anet-Isheshek aYeso wu fɛ́ a kin ku, ama iku me, Adakunom tɛ a ku donong ni kutset, yɔkɔnɔng, a se ni sonong ni bɔk iyak Adakunom, a tsin ras awon mok iyit. <verse eid="ROM 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35" />Angan da kyem a ki kam yit ni ishim Anet-Isheshek yɛ? Ki ndaam ɛ? Ki izot ɛ? Ki mgbang ɛ? Ki nzong ɛ? Ke avit ares ite yɛ? Ke kawɛy ɛ? Ke awal ɛ? <verse eid="ROM 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36" />Ki i di se ni ijɛk ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">&lt;&lt;Nek ngɔn, in di nyis yit ni iku</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 8:36">kaakyi kunom;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">Ba ki sok yit ti ítsamang</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 8:36">fɛ́ ba tse ba tsɛk.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37" />Koba! Ayɛt akaakyi ikyɛng, iyit waat yit agap bayɔng fɛ́ ba ya mben, ni irèn ayɔng fɛ́ a ki shim yit. <verse eid="ROM 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38" />Nek imi rēn tsɛngtsɛng fok vit iku kɛ kutset, kɛ batomaza kɛ itséng, kɛ nkyɔrɔk ayɔkɔnɔng kɛ nyɔng fi in bi bɛ́ ayi, kɛ bafi kukyem, <verse eid="ROM 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39" />kɛ kusɔp kɛ kutsik, kɛ ikikak fɛ́ ba nye ide, fi i da kyem i ki kam yit ni ishim Adakunom fi i ne na Anet-Isheshek aYeso aTisa yit awo.<verse eid="ROM 8:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9" />
  <para style="s">Adakunom myak aIsrela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1" />Anet-Isheshek rēn fok in tsin cɛɛt atsak, imi tsin ki wɔrɔk yin awo. Kabik aJɛrɛ di tonong tsɛngtsɛng ayɛt kuyiring iyɛ hom, fok da in tsin cɛɛt mbɔɔs awo. <verse eid="ROM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2" />Nek in bɛ̀ kudaam ni itusup iyɛ makiyi ayɛt iyɛ hom. <verse eid="ROM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3" />Zɔng kin ishim, kawɛy di kpa ni imi, na ba di kam na aKristi akuce banet hom, bafi izit hom, <verse eid="ROM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4" />banet aIsrela. Iba fɛ́ Adakunom kasa ti nnon wu, iba fɛ́ Adakunom ka ba te iratek, Adakunom kin rosom kushii ni iba, iba fɛ́ ba kin shan ntsi, iba fi kutu iya Adakunom ntong se ni iba, ni kushii fɛ́ Adakunom man nye ni iba. <verse eid="ROM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5" />Bada badakop yit kin ne ni izit bá, ni nse anet awe, Anet-Isheshek me kin ne ni izit bá, iwu fɛ́ a yet Adakunom aza kaangan, na ba tere iyerek wu kaakyi izen! Anɔng.<verse eid="ROM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6" />Da ayet fok, ifɛ́ Adakunom kpa na abap awo. Nek da ayet kaangan fɛ́ a ne ni izit aIsrela wu fɛ́ a yet atitup afi aIsrela awo. <verse eid="ROM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7" />Da ayet kaangan fɛ́ a ne ni izit aIbrahim iwu fɛ́ a yet atitup arim aIbrahim awo, nek kucɛɛt ka fɛ́ Adakunom kin fɛ̀ ni aIbrahim ye, &lt;&lt;Ayet ni irɔm aIshaku wu fɛ́ ba bi di fa izit ngɔn.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8" />Idɔng tonong fok, da ayet ngma nnon fɛ́ ba sɛs ina ni irɔm fɛ́ na yet nnon Adakunom awo, tit na yɔng fɛ́ ba tes ina kpaf ti kushii fɛ́ Adakunom nye, fɛ́ na yet nnon aIbrahim. <verse eid="ROM 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9" />Nek ane wu fɛ́ ba kin nye kushii me, &lt;&lt;Na kpaf ishining izen, in bi tin bɛ́s in, aSara bi tes nggon.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10" />Ayet idɔng kyɛk awo, nek nnon aRebeka kin ne na ada azining, ada yit aIshaku. <verse eid="ROM 9:10" /><verse number="11-12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11-12" />Ngma na anɔng, na ba resek dang tes nafɛrɛs e, Adakunom kin fɛ̀ na aRebeka ye, &lt;&lt;Ako me, bi ra a wosong e isam.&gt;&gt; Anɔng e kin te ni iba resek dang ra ikyi ikak itek ki imaan e ayi. Adakunom kin cɛɛt anɔng, nɔng ayɔng fi iwu mi kasa ayɛt ite iyɛ wu, ni isot anɔng, da nek kutomong fɛ́ anet e me ra awo. <verse eid="ROM 9:11-12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13" />Kyɔn ti i di se ni ijɛk ye, &lt;&lt;Imi shim aYakub, imi ramin aIsuwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14" />Akyɛ fi in da fɛ̀ kong ɛ? Adakunom ras ishɔt ishim ice yɛ? Koba! <verse eid="ROM 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15" />Nek Adakunom kin fɛ̀ na aMusa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:15">&lt;&lt;In da nye itek sak na ayɔng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:15">fi in da nye itek ni wu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:15">in da fok angmishish ayɔng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:15">fi in da fok angmishish wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16" />Nek anɔng, da ikasa me se nek kushim kɛ inye anet awe awo, tit itek fɛ́ Adakunom tonoso. <verse eid="ROM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17" />Nek ifɛ̀ Adakunom kin fɛ̀ na aFirauna ye, &lt;&lt;Imi kin da ta i sot agwɔm, nek ikyɛng deng, nɔng in bin di tonong kukyem hom naton ngɔn, nɔng ba bin di shara iyerek hom azatse ngma kusum.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18" />Na anɔng, Adakunom nye itek sak na ayɔng fi iwu shim a da nye itek, na rosom iyɛ ayɔng fi iwu shim a rosom iyɛ wu.<verse eid="ROM 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19" />Nyɛng akak ayɛt yin di ki rip ye, &lt;&lt;Wɛt akyɛ sak fɛ́ Adakunom rēn ki tsɛt yit mo ni inɛn ɛ? Nek angan kyem na rawu kushim wu yɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20" />Awɛt ingɔn anet awe! Ngɔn yet angan fi i da bun Adakunom ni ifɛ̀ yɛ? Ikyɛng fɛ́ ba nye i da kyem ni ifɛ̀ na anet fɛ́ a nye ide ye, &lt;&lt;Akyɛ sak fi i di nye anɔng ɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21" />Anet inok nadonong irɔp, a bi ízɔk fɛ́ a da bɔ ayɛt irɔp izining e na di nok nadonong nakak na fi kutomong izén-izén nɛ na ma nok nakak na fi kutomong akaakyi izen awɛ?<verse eid="ROM 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22" />Won in fɛ̀ yit ke Adakunom shim a tonong naman wu, ni kukyem wu wɛshɛk. Ngma na anɔng, ayɛt kutsik akabɔk Adakunom, a nye kabɔk na bayɔng fɛ́ ba mi kyem naman wu na na di tik ni ba, na ma wey ni iba. <verse eid="ROM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23" />Anɔng wu fɛ́ Adakunom shim, a di tonong kutsik ízɔk wu na bayɔng fi iwu shim a ka ba tonong itek wu, bayɔng fi iwu man myak gyam nɔng ba bin sɛ ízɔk wu. <verse eid="ROM 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24" />Iyit yet yit bayɔng fi iwu mi kasa me, ayet baYahuda kyɛk aziba awo, ngma ni Ícɛn-iduk bá. <verse eid="ROM 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25" />Kyɔn tɛ fɛ́ Adakunom kin di fɛ̀ ni fumung aHosiya ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">&lt;&lt;Bayɔng fɛ́ ba yet banet hom awo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">in bi ka ba yes &lt;banet hom;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">icɛ́n fi i tsang yet icek iyɛ hom awo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">in da yes iye &lt;icek iyɛ hom.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26" />&lt;&lt;I bi te ana, na akpaf arɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:26">fɛ́ ba kin di fɛ̀ ni ba ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:26">&lt;Iyin yet yin banet hom awo,&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:26">azɔng e, ba bi ka ba yes,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:26">&lt;nnon Adakunom fɛ́ a yet atset.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27" />AIshaya tos nek aIsrela, a fɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:27">&lt;&lt;Ngma ni kudot nnon aIsrela</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:27">fɛ́ na se ti nzɛk anu izɛk,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:27">nkum bayɔng fɛ́ ba kyɛk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:27">fɛ́ ba bi ka ba sheshek.<verse eid="ROM 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28" />Nek Adakunom bi ra</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:28">ngma kazatse ishɔt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:28">vit ibeseng izen sak ni igang.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29" />Kyɔn tɛ fi aIshaya mi di cɛɛt ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">&lt;&lt;Ke da nek aTisa Azɔk-Bazɔk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:29">kin di shemeng ice wu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:29">ija me awo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">ki in mi sot yit tɛ aSodom</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:29">ki in mi sot yit tɛ aGomora.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">AIsrela raba dang nɔɔk atsak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30" />Akyɛ fi in da fɛ̀ yit kong ɛ? Fok Ícɛn-iduk fi i tsang irade kusot kutabat, ba mi sɛ iko. Ba sɛ kusot kutabat e me, ni irèn inɔɔk atsak. <verse eid="ROM 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31" />Awɛt bafɛ́ aIsrela fɛ́ ba tsɛsɛk kusot kutabat ni irèn ikuus ntsi, da ba kyem ba sɛ iko awo. <verse eid="ROM 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32" />Akyɛ sak anɔng ɛ? Nek ba di kuus irèn inɔɔk atsak awo, ba sok fok ba sɛs nek ntomong ice bá. Ba turuk kutak, &lt;&lt;Ni kuta fi kusas ituu atak.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33" />Kyɔn ti i di se ni ijɛk,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">&lt;&lt;Di yin, in mi sak kuta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">fi ku saas ituu atak na aSihiyona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">Kuta fi ku ka ba saas ikpas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">awɛt ngma ayɔng fɛ́</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">a nɔɔk atsak ni iwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">a bi sɔ nsum awo jɛm-jɛm.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1" />Ábaruneng, kushim iyɛ hom, nɛ awon hom sak na Adakunom nek bafi aIsrela yet fok, na ba sɛ isheshek. <verse eid="ROM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2" />Nek imi da kyem in nɔk kanu ifɛ̀ akuce bá fok, ba bi iyɛ ingash na Adakunom akabes, awɛt iyɛ ingash e ni i se naton irēn awo. <verse eid="ROM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3" />Nek ba kyem ba rēn kusot kutabat fi ku nes na Adakunom awo, ba tsɛsɛk itup kusot kutabat kufuba. Nek anɔng, ba raba inabak ice bá sak ni kusot kutabat fi ku nes na Adakunom. <verse eid="ROM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4" />Nek Anet-Isheshek wu fɛ́ a yet igang ntsi, nɔng kaangan fɛ́ a nɔɔk atsak, bin sɛ kusot kutabat ashon Adakunom.<verse eid="ROM 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isheshek yet ifɛ́ akaangan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5" />AMusa jɛk irèn kusot kutabat fɛ́ ba sɛs ni irèn ikuus ntsi: &lt;&lt;Anet fɛ́ a nye ikyɛng fi ntsi me fɛ̀, a da sot nek ina.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6" />Awɛt kusot kutabat fɛ́ ba sɛs ni irèn inɔɔk atsak fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;I bi fɛ̀ ayɛt iyɛ ngɔn ye, &lt;Angan bi ngarak sak azanɛn ɛ?&gt; Nek, na a tik na Anet-Isheshek na azatse yɛ.<verse eid="ROM 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7" />&lt;&lt;Kɛ &lt;Angan da tik tsik aben ɛ?&gt; &gt;&gt; Nek, na a tun Anet-Isheshek ni irɛk ɛ.<verse eid="ROM 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8" />Awɛt akyɛ fi ijɛk e fɛ̀ yɛ? &lt;&lt;Ifɛ̀ me se bakat ni iyin, i se na anu yin, i se ayɛt ayɛ yin,&gt;&gt; Idɔng tonong, ifɛ̀ inɔɔk atsak fi in tsin shara yit; <verse eid="ROM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9" />Fok, ki i tak na kanu ngɔn fok, &lt;&lt;AYeso yet aTisa,&gt;&gt; i nɔɔk atsak ayɛt iyɛ ngɔn fok, Adakunom ku donong ni irɛk, i da sɛ isheshek. <verse eid="ROM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10" />Nek iyet ni iyɛ de fɛ́ anet di shan atsak, na di sɛ kusot kutabat. I ti yet ne kanu wu fɛ́ anet di tak fok, aYeso yet aTisa, na di sɛ isheshek. <verse eid="ROM 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11" />Ti ifɛ̀ Adakunom di fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a nɔɔk atsak ni iwu, a da sɔ nsum awo jɛm-jɛm.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12" />Nek vit ikaba, ke ni i yet afɛ́ aYahuda, ke afi Ícɛn-iduk ayi, aTisa azining e yet afɛ́ akaangan, a di tes itek wu na akaangan fɛ́ a tsɛt a ku sɛ mo. <verse eid="ROM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13" />Nek, &lt;&lt;Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a yes iyerek aTisa, a da sɛ isheshek.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14" />Na anɛ fɛ́ ba da yes ayɔng fɛ́ da ba di nɔɔk atsak ni wu awɛ? Na anɛ fɛ́ ba di ki nɔɔk atsak na ayɔng fɛ́ ba man fok ikyi ikak naton wu awɛ? Na anɛ fɛ́ ba da fok dang akak na ka ba shara ifɛ̀ me yɛ? <verse eid="ROM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15" />Na anɛ fɛ́ ba da shara ifɛ̀ me ke da ba tom akak ni ba awɛ? Ti i di se ni ijɛk, &lt;&lt;Di yin fɛ́ atak bafi ishara ifɛ̀ itek di sas makiyi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16" />Awɛt i ni se fok da ngma bafi aIsrela ba, ba nɔɔk atsak ni ifɛ̀ itek e me awo. Nek aIshaya jɛk fok, &lt;&lt;ATisa, angan nɔɔk atsak ni itom yit ɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17" />Nek anɔng, inɔɔk atsak nes nek ifoos itom e, ba foos itom e ni irèn ishara ifɛ̀ Anet-Isheshek. <verse eid="ROM 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18" />Won in rip ane: Ba ki mang fok ifɛ̀ me awɛ? Ey, ba mang fok;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">&lt;&lt;Ntɔ bá mi wuru kaakyɛ azatse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:18">ntɔ bá in mi tsin in ta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:18">ni igang azatse.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19" />Won in tin rip ane: Bafi aIsrela rēn ifɛ̀ me awɛ? AMusa kin tun fɛ̀ ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">&lt;&lt;Imi da sak i da fok yin ifup</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:19">bayɔng fɛ́ da ba kyem kuwɔp awo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">in da sak ayɛ yin da beseng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:19">azaton banet fɛ́ ba se vit irēn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20" />Wat aIshaya kin fɛrɛng ni iyɛ ting ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">&lt;&lt;Banet fɛ́ da ba di tsɛt awo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:20">ayet iba ba ba di sɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">imi tonong ice hom sak na</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:20">bayɔng fɛ́ da ba di tsɛt awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21" />Awɛt a fɛ̀ ane sak ni aIsrela,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:21">&lt;&lt;Nkum kadiding sak kahwyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:21">in nabak kubɔk hom sak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:21">na bayɔng fɛ́ ba raba ifok ifɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:21">na ágadiring ánet.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11" />
  <para style="s">Nshɛrɛp bafi aIsrela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1" />In shim in rip ane; Adakunom rawu banet wu yɛ? Koba! Nek imi ice hom, in yet afɛ́ aIsrela, fi in ne ni izit aIbrahim, in ne ni izɔrɔk aBanyami. <verse eid="ROM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2" />Adakunom ki mang rawu banet wu, bayɔng fi iwu ki mang kasa awo. Iyin rēn yin ikyɛng fi ifɛ̀ Adakunom kin fɛ̀, naton kukun fi aIliya kin nye naton banet aIsrela ashon Adakunom awɛ? <verse eid="ROM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3" />&lt;&lt;ATisa, ba mi fɛs batan ngɔn, ba mi yirik narɔ kuta ashosh ngɔn, imi azi hom kyɛk fi in di tuk, bayɔng ba tsin tsɛt kutset hom.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4" />Awɛt akyɛ fɛ́ Adakunom kin fɛ̀ ni iwu yɛ? &lt;&lt;Imi mi sak ice hom banet agup kanakataat, bayɔng fɛ́ da ba man te gururuk akut bá na aBaal awo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5" />I se kpaf anɔng ni izen iyeng, ishɛrɛp banet di se, fɛ́ Adakunom mi myak ayɛt itek wu. <verse eid="ROM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6" />Ki ikasa me yet nek itek Adakunom, idɔng tonong fok, i yet nek kutomong kutek awo, nek ki ifi i yet nek kutomong e wu, idɔng tonong fok, itek Adakunom e sot ifɛ́ atsak awo.<verse eid="ROM 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7" />Wɛt i da se anɛ? Ikyɛng fɛ́ banet aIsrela kin tsɛt makiyi ba bit ide, awɛt bayɔng fɛ́ Adakunom kasa iba ba ba sɛ ide, awɛt ishɛrɛp e sot gbarak. <verse eid="ROM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8" />Kyɔn ti i di se ni jɛk ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:8">&lt;&lt;Adakunom ka ba nɔk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:8">kabik ishɔp,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:8">a ka ba nɔk ayisi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:8">fɛ́ da a yɛrɛ awo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:8">na ato fɛ́ da a foos awo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:8">sak atut ana.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9" />ADauda fɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">&lt;&lt;Won kuyak bá</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:9">ni ku ka ba sot agunung,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:9">fɛ́ a da ka ba yisik,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">won na a ka ba sot kuta ikpas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:9">na a ka ba sot ishɔt.<verse eid="ROM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10" />Won ayisi bá</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:10">na a sot hwyinin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:10">kɔn ba bi yɛrɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:10">won nama bá na na gɔmɔsɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:10">ayɛ ne ayɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ahwyang fɛ́ ba bas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11" />Won in ban rip ane, ikpa bafi aIsrela me se vit idorok ɛ? Koba! Anɛn bà te mok Ícɛn-iduk bin di sɛ kawat isheshek, nɔng i da bin sak bafi aIsrela di fok ifup. <verse eid="ROM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12" />Ki inɛn bafi aIsrela bɛ́ ni itek sak azatse, ki kurat bá bɛ́ ni itek sak ni Ícɛn-iduk, wat iyin di yin, itek e bi se anɛ ni izen fɛ́ ba bi moon bafi aIsrela nɛ bayɔng fɛ́ Adakunom mi ka ba sheshek ɛ?<verse eid="ROM 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13" />Imi tsin cɛɛt ni iyin bafi Ícɛn-iduk. Ayet fok imi yet atom aYeso sak ni Ícɛn-iduk, in da bamang kukaa ni kutomong kang fi in se ne, <verse eid="ROM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14" />ni ite iyɛ fok, nyen in sak banet hom ba di fok ifup, nyen bakak ayɛt bà di sɛ isheshek. <verse eid="ROM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15" />Nek ki iraye fɛ́ Adakunom ka ba raba, i yet inosong-ashi sak azatse, wat izen fɛ́ ba bi ka ba shan, i bi se tɛ banet fɛ́ ba ka ba donong ni kutset awɛ? <verse eid="ROM 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16" />Ki icɛk akpam fɛ́ ba nabak Adakunom e, tɛ nayak imɛsɛng se jɛrɛ, a sot ngma akpam e se jɛrɛ, kɛ aney akon e se jɛrɛ, a sot ahwyang e se jɛrɛ bà.<verse eid="ROM 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17" />Ke ba mi tɛmɛng ahwyang e akak, ba ki tup yin mo iyin, fi i yet yin atin-akon ifat ayit akon e, yɔkɔnɔng i tsin sɔ yin nta fi in nes na aney akon ifat e. <verse eid="ROM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18" />Nek anɔng, i bi ka nye yin kukaa ti iyin got yin ahwyang aya awo. Nek ke i nye yin anɔng, yiring yin ni fɛ̀ de, da ahwyang na a gbinding aney e awo, tit aney e na a gbinding ahwyang e me. <verse eid="ROM 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19" />Nyen iyin nɔng i da fɛ̀ yin, &lt;&lt;Ba ki mang tɛsɛng ahwyang e, nek ba ki bas yit mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20" />Ifɛ̀ me dɔng anɔng, ba kin tɛsɛng ina na akon e nek avit inɔɔk atsak na, iyin nyeseng yin nek inɔɔk atsak yin, nek anɔng, i bi nye yin kukaa awo, tit ni i sot yin ayɛt inyim. <verse eid="ROM 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21" />Nek ke da atitup ahwyang e kyem a hwyet ni bɔk Adakunom awo, iyin da kyem ihwyet yin bà awo.<verse eid="ROM 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22" />Na anɔng wu, in di di yit itek ni ife Adakunom. A tonoso ife wu sak na bayɔng fɛ́ ba kpas, awɛt na tonoso itek wu sak ni yin, ki i ya yin kashon ni kusot ayɛt itek wu, ke i nye yin anɔng awo, ba da ki tɛn yin bà. <verse eid="ROM 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23" />Ki bafi aIsrela wosong avit inɔɔk atsak bá, ba da tɛ ba ka ba tup na akon e, nek Adakunom bi ízɔk inye anɔng e. <verse eid="ROM 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24" />Ke ba kin ki tɛmɛng yin na kakon ifat ayit, ikyɛng fi ise gbang na ba nye, ba tɛ ba ki sɛp yin na kakon ifat fɛ́ ba tup ari, akyɛ da ni gaat na ba sɛp ihwyang akon yɔng fɛ ba tɛmɛng na kakon kuri kuzining e yɔng ɛ?<verse eid="ROM 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Adakunom bi sheshek <optbreak /> bafi aIsrela ngma kusum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25" />Ábaruneng, imi shim ni i rēn yin ikyɛng inɛt deng, kɔn i bi ka nye yin kukaa fok iyin bɛ̀ yin irēn. Nshɛrɛp bafi aIsrela di bang ni kugbarak ice, anɔng e ya kashon sak izen fi kudot bafi Ícɛn-iduk mi sɛs ku bɛ́s na Anet-Isheshek. <verse eid="ROM 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26" />Na anɔng wu fɛ́ ba di ki sheshek bafi aIsrela ngma kusum, kyɔn ti i di se ni jɛk,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:26">&lt;&lt;Anet-Isheshek e bi ne na aSihiyona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:26">a bi tirik bafi izɔrɔk aYakub</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:26">sak ni ikuus Adakunom.<verse eid="ROM 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27" />Irosom kushi hom</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:27">bi se ane ni iba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:27">ni izen fi in bi kaba fuut anɛn bá.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28" />Nek ba raba ifɛ̀ itek, bafi aIsrela sot bafi ifa na Adakunom, anɔng e te nek itek Ícɛn-iduk, awɛt nek ikasa fɛ́ Adakunom ka ba nye ne, ba sot icɛk iyɛ Adakunom nek badakop bá, <verse eid="ROM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29" />Nek kunang Adakunom ni imyak wu se vit ishesheng. <verse eid="ROM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30" />Kyɔn ti iyin fi i tsang rayin ifoos ifɛ̀ Adakunom, awɛt yɔkɔnɔng, Adakunom mi fok angmishish yin nek iraye Adakunom fɛ́ bafi aIsrela nye, <verse eid="ROM 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31" />yɔkɔnɔng, iba mi sot bafi iraye Adakunom, nɔng ba bin di sɛ angmishish Adakunom e yɔng fi iwu kin ki nye yin ne. <verse eid="ROM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32" />Nek Adakunom mi rosom banet ngma ayɛt iraye, nɔng a da sɛ a bin tonong angmishish wu na kaangan.<verse eid="ROM 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itere sak na Adakunom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33" />Di yin, kutsik irēn ni kutsitsɛng Adakunom!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:33">Angan da kyem a rēn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:33">irèn ishɔt wu yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:33">ni irén inyes nkyɔrɔk wu yɛ?<verse eid="ROM 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34" />&lt;&lt;Angan man kyem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:34">a rēn kuyiring Adakunom ɛ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:34">Ke angan man sot</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:34">anet itabak wu yɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35" />&lt;&lt;Angan man nɔk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:35">Adakunom akyɛ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:35">Fɛ́ a tsɛt na a ku tarang ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36" />Nek kaakyɛ nes ni wu, iwu berese kaakyɛ, kaakyɛ se nek iwu. Won na ba ku nesek iratek ayɛ ne ayɛ. Anɔng.<verse eid="ROM 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12" />
  <para style="s">Kusot fi ku se gyat <optbreak /> anu ashon Adakunom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1" />Nek anɔng ábaruneng, in tsin ra awon ni iyin nek angmishish fɛ́ Adakunom mi nye, nasap nrɔm yin tɛ kunang kutset, kuyɔng fi ku se jɛrɛ, ikyɛng fɛ́ Adakunom shim, nek anɔng e yet irèn iya ntong abik yin in fɛ́ atsak. <verse eid="ROM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2" />I bi ti ikuus yin nggɔn azatse kang awo, won yin Adakunom na a shesheng kuyiring yin ni nggɔn yin. Na anɔng wu, i da kyem imara yin, ni rēn yin ikyɛng fɛ́ Adakunom shim, idɔng fi i se gyat, ikyɛng ishim, i ti se yɛɛt.<verse eid="ROM 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3" />Nek itek fɛ́ Adakunom mi di nɔɔk, in shim in ki tak yin ngma yin fok, da akak bi mak nye kukaa fi ku naat agap wu awo, tit na a nɔ ni nhwyɛ wu ni irèn fɛ́ a di yɛrɛ ice wu, na a sas ice wu kpaf ti inɔɔk atsak fɛ́ Adakunom ku nɔɔk. <verse eid="ROM 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4" />Kyɔn tɛ fɛ́ kaangan yit di bɛ̀ nkap irɔm zizɛɛt, wat nkap e bi ntomong na zizɛɛt-zizɛɛt, <verse eid="ROM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5" />i se kpaf anɔng ayɛt Anet-Isheshek, iyit fi in se yit dot, in mi sot yit kurɔm kuzining, kaakyɛ azining yit yet kukap afidang.<verse eid="ROM 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6" />Ngma yit in bɛ̀ yit nnang zizɛɛt-zizɛɛt kpaf ni itek fɛ́ ba mi ki nɔɔk yit. Ki kunang anet yet itaas ibes, won na a ra kutomong ni ide kpaf ni inɔɔk atsak wu. <verse eid="ROM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7" />Ki kunang ngɔn yet kufi iras kutomong igbingding banet, ra iko. Ki kunang ngɔn yet ifi itees banet, ra itees e. <verse eid="ROM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8" />Ki ku yet kufi ites banet gbagba, na ya kashon e. Ki ku yet kufi inesek kunang, won na nesek ni kubɔk washak. Ki ku yet kufi akɔk-ashon, won na a kɔk banet e yɛlɛl. Ki ku yet kufi itonoso angmishish, won na a nye anɔng ni iyɛ ikan.<verse eid="ROM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Irèn fɛ́ ba di ki rēn afi ikuus atsak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9" />Won ishim yin ni i yet ifɛ́ atsak. Rayin ikyɛng fi i yet imaan e; di fit yin ni idɔng fi i yet itek. <verse eid="ROM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10" />Di te yin ice ni ishim barunyining, nesek yin bafidang iratek aza ice yin. <verse eid="ROM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11" />Te yin nyɛk ni kutomong yin, i bi sot yin bafɛ́ arut awo, ra yin kutomong Adakunom ayɛt abik. <verse eid="ROM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12" />Nye yin ifeng nek ite iyɛ yin, nye yin akabɔk ayɛt mgbang, ras yin awon kaaki izen. <verse eid="ROM 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13" />Kabasa yin ikyɛng fi i bɛ̀ yin ne banet Adakunom fɛ́ ba se dang ikyɛng, shashang yin batsen na nasa yin.<verse eid="ROM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14" />Di tes yin itek sak na bayɔng fɛ́ ba ki nesek yin mgbang, ka ba tes yin mo itek, da kawɛy awo. <verse eid="ROM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15" />Nyes yin ifeng gung na bayɔng fɛ́ ba se ni ifeng, nyes yin kafa kawe gung na bayɔng fɛ́ ba se ayɛt kafa kawe. <verse eid="ROM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16" />Nyes yin kusot kukyang na bafidang. I bi kok yin ice yin garang awo, mon yin ice yin na bayɔng fɛ́ ba se aben ni iyin, i bi sok yin ice yin ti i got yin bakak itsɛ́ng awo.<verse eid="ROM 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17" />I bi tarang yin bayɔng fɛ́ ba ki nye yin anyas, na anyas awo. Nye yin yɛɛt ni ikyɛng fi i da nye yin, fi i da se gyat ashon banet ngma kusum. <verse eid="ROM 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18" />Ki i da nye, ki nek ikyɛng fi ingɔn da nye wu, nye kusot kukyang na akaangan. <verse eid="ROM 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19" />Ábaruneng, i bi tirik yin anyas na anyas awo, tit ni won yin Adakunom bi ki tarang yin ne ni izen naman wu, nek i se ni ijɛk ye, &lt;&lt;Itarang kutomong anyas yet inaan, imi bi ka ba tarang,&gt;&gt; aTisa wu a fɛrɛng anɔng. <verse eid="ROM 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20" />Ifɛ̀ Adakunom ti i fɛ̀ ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:20">&lt;&lt;Ke afidang ifa ngɔn foos nzong,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 12:20">ya ni wu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:20">ke a foos iyɛ ngash,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 12:20">ku nɔɔk ashi isɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:20">Na anɔng wu, i da sot ti i tsin ku</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 12:20">korok aca-rong ni ice wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21" />I bi won yin anyas na a ya awɛng naton yin awo, tit itek fi iras yin ni i ya awɛng naton anyas.<verse eid="ROM 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13" />
  <para style="s">Ifoos ifɛ̀ bakɔk-ashon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1" />Won kaangan na a sot afi ifoos ifɛ̀ bakɔk-ashon, nek vit kukyem igwɔm ke da Adakunom tarak irèn e awo. Nek ngma bayɔng fɛ́ ba tsin ya igwɔm yɔkɔnɔng, Adakunom wu a ka ba nɔɔk. <verse eid="ROM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2" />Nek anɔng, ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a se ni ifa na bayɔng fɛ́ ba se na ata isosok igwɔm, i sot a se ni ifa ni ikyɛng fɛ́ Adakunom nye, bayɔng fɛ́ ba nye anɔng e, ba tsin kɔk ice bá ishɔt. <verse eid="ROM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3" />Nek bafi igwɔm yet ikyɛng nnyim sak na bafi nggɔn ntek awo tit sak na bayɔng fɛ́ ba ras imaan ikyɛng. Ngɔn shim i sot vit nnyim bafi igwɔm ɛ? Nye ikyɛng fi i se yɛɛt, i da sɛ itere wu. <verse eid="ROM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4" />Nek iwu yet asam Adakunom fɛ́ a da ka ba nye itek. Awɛt ki ngɔn nye ikyɛng imaan e, ku teng wu, nek awal fɛ́ a se ni bɔk wu a yet afi kuro awo. Nek iwu yet asam Adakunom fɛ́ a tisik na naman wu, ni ishɔt wu naton bayɔng fɛ́ ba ras imaan e.<verse eid="ROM 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5" />Nek anɔng, i se gbing-gbing ni inabak yin ice yin sak na bayɔng fɛ́ ba se na ata igwɔm, da nek nnyim itabak awo, tit nek ayɛ yin ki tonong yin anɔng. <verse eid="ROM 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6" />Anɔng wu sak fi i di tarasa yin itsɔm mben, nek bafi igwɔm e yet basam Adakunom, fɛ́ ba nesek izen bá ngma kusum nek kutomong igwɔm. <verse eid="ROM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7" />Tarang yin kaangan ikyɛng fɛ́ a ki kuus yin, ke ba ki kuus yin itsɔm mben, ni tarang yin ide, kɛ na a yet itsɔm fɛ́ ba tarasa naton ares ayi, ka ba nɔɔk yin ide, ke a yet bayɔng fɛ́ ba kyem na ba fok nnyim bá, ni fok yin nnyim bá, ki i yet inesek iratek, ni ka ba nesek yin iratek e.<verse eid="ROM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tonoso yin ishim sak na <optbreak /> bayɔng fɛ́ ba ki mɔɔt yin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8" />Ba bi ki kuus yin kuta ikikak awo, tit kufi iya kashon itonoso ishim sak na bafidang, nek ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a tonong ishim sak na afidang, a mi shining ntsi. <verse eid="ROM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9" />Ntsi me fɛ̀ ye, &lt;&lt;I bi ra kujang awo, i bi sok kutset akak awo, i bi yi ikyɛng akak awo, i bi te kuhwyɛ ni ikyɛng akak awo.&gt;&gt; Ni ishɛrɛp ntsi me ngma, ba kunung ina ni ifɛ̀ izining de ye, &lt;&lt;Shim afidang isot ngɔn ti ice ngɔn.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10" />Ki i shim afidang isot ngɔn, i da ku nye anyas awo. Nek anɔng, ishim ye, i yet ishining ntsi.<verse eid="ROM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11" />Nye yin anɔng, ni rēn yin kuri izen fi in di se yit yɔkɔnɔng. Izen mi nye, fi i da shemeng yin ni nda yin, nek izen isheshek yit se bakat yɔkɔnɔng aza izen fi in kin di nɔɔk yit atsak. <verse eid="ROM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12" />Katuk mi bɛ́ bakat igang, kadiding ngmash na ka tarak. Nek anɔng, won in wobok yit ntomong nhwyi, won in te yit ares itsom afi mgbey. <verse eid="ROM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13" />Won nggɔn yit ni i sot gyat, tɛ bafi mgbey, da na ba ki sɛs yin ayɛt ngu ice ni isɔ ni ifeng awo, kɛ iras kubi ni itsɛsɛk nta abap awo, da na ba ki sɛ yin ni itsɛsɛk ifa ni ifup awo. <verse eid="ROM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14" />Tit ni sok yin nggɔn aTisa aYeso Kristi, da i bi tarak yin kawat nek ikɔk irɔm awo.<verse eid="ROM 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14" />
  <para style="s">I bi tsɛɛt akak ishɔt awo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1" />Shan yin ayɔng fɛ́ a se buk-buk ayɛt inɔɔk atsak, i bi woso ikɔk yin nanan ni iwu azaton ncɛɛt fi in se aben awo. <verse eid="ROM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2" />Inɔɔk atsak akak, ku nɔɔk na a ya kaakyi ikyɛng, awɛt akak fɛ́ a se buk-buk ni inɔɔk atsak, a ya ikon kyɛk. <verse eid="ROM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3" />Won ayɔng fɛ́ a ya kaakyi ikyɛng, a bi byɛs ayɔng fɛ́ da a ya kaakyi ikyɛng awo; won ayɔng fɛ́ da a ya kaakyi ikyɛng e awo, a bi tsɛɛt ayɔng fɛ́ a ya kaakyi ikyɛng e ishɔt awo, nek Adakunom mi ku shan. <verse eid="ROM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4" />Ngɔn yet angan fi i da tsɛɛt asam akak ishɔt ɛ? Atekari wu wu kyɛk fɛ́ a rēn fok, ke a tsin tseng gyat a? Kɛ a mi kpa yɛ? A da kyem a nyeseng, nek aTisa da kyem a ku sak na a nyeseng.<verse eid="ROM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5" />Akak sok kunom kukak ku wat kukak, na akak sok nnom e ngma in se nagbirigbɔng. Kaangan na a bereng ikyɛng fi kuyiring wu ku nɔɔk. <verse eid="ROM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6" />Ayɔng fɛ́ a sok kunom kukak ku wat e, a nye anɔng nek Adakunom di sɛ iratek. Ayɔng fɛ́ a ya kaakyi ikyɛng, a nye anɔng nek Adakunom di sɛ iratek, nek a nyes ifeng sak na Adakunom. Ayɔng fɛ́ a kasa nayak, a nye anɔng nek Adakunom di sɛ iratek, nek a nyes ifeng sak na Adakunom. <verse eid="ROM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7" />Nek vit akak ayɛt yit fɛ́ a se ni kutset nek itek ice wu, vit ayɔng fɛ́ a ku nek itek ice wu. <verse eid="ROM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8" />Ki in se yit ni kutset, in se yit ni kutset nek aTisa, ki in ku yit, in ku yit nek aTisa. Nek anɔng, ke ni in se yit ni kutset a kɛ in ku yit ayi, in yet yit bafɛ́ aTisa.<verse eid="ROM 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9" />Nek ikyɛng deng de fi i sak Anet-Isheshek di ku, a tɛ a shemeng ni kutset, nɔng a di sot aTisa bafi kutset nɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba mi ku. <verse eid="ROM 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10" />Wat ngɔn, akyɛ sak fi i tsɛk arunyining ishɔt ɛ? Kɛ akyɛ sak fi ibyɛs arunyining ɛ? Nek ngma yit in bi nyeseng yit ashon ishɔt Adakunom. <verse eid="ROM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11" />Nek i se ni ijɛk ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">&lt;&lt;ATisa fɛ̀ ye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">&lt;Imi shemeng ni kutset hom,&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">&lt;kaakyi ikuut,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">bi te gururuk ashon hom;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">kaakyi ilem bi fɛrɛng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">fok imi yet Adakunom.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12" />Na anɔng, kaangan bi fa kutomong wu anu ashon Adakunom.<verse eid="ROM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13" />Nek anɔng, won yin itsɛɛk bafidang ishɔt. Tit kaangan na a sok ni iyɛ wu fok, da iwu da sot kuta ikpa akak awo, ki ikyɛng isɛ inɛn sak na akak awo. <verse eid="ROM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14" />Tɛ ayɔng fɛ́ a se ayɛt aTisa aYeso, imi rēn wɛshɛk fok, vit nayak fɛ́ da na se cɛ́l awo, awɛt ke akak sok fok nayak nakak se cɛ́l awo, i sot anɔng sak ni wu. <verse eid="ROM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15" />Ke arunyining nɔ kudaam azaton ikyɛng fi i tsin ya, i sot ngɔn bi ishim arunyining awo. I bi won ikyɛng fi i tsin ya ni i wey na arunyining fɛ́ Anet-Isheshek ku nek iwu awo. <verse eid="ROM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16" />I bi won ikyɛng fi ngɔn sok fok i yet itek, na ba cɛɛt naton de ti imaan e awo. <verse eid="ROM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17" />Nek igwɔm Adakunom yet ifi iyak ni isɔs awo, tit kusot kutabat, kusot kukyang ni ifeng ayɛt Kabik aJɛrɛ. <verse eid="ROM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18" />Nek ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a kuus Anet-Isheshek anɔng, a tɛrɛk Adakunom iyɛ, na sɛs irun ama na banet.<verse eid="ROM 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19" />Nek anɔng, won ni in te nyɛk yit na akaakyi irèn, ni in ras yit ikyɛng fi ibɛ́s ni kusot kukyang, ni inok ace yit. <verse eid="ROM 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20" />I bi won yin kucɛɛt iyak, ni ku beseng kutomong Adakunom awo. Kaakyi kuyak se cɛ́l, awɛt da i se yɛɛt anet na a ya ikyɛng fi i da sak akak ikpa awo. <verse eid="ROM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21" />Idung se gyat anet na a rawu iya nayak, kɛ na rawu isɔ ashi anap, kɛ na a nye ikyi ikak fi i da sak arunyining ikpa.<verse eid="ROM 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22" />Won kuyiring fi i bɛ̀ naton ikyɛng deng, ni i sot nate ngɔn nɛ Adakunom. Awɛng se naton anet yɔng fi da iyɛ wu kutsɛk ishɔt naton ikyɛng fɛ́ mi di nyeseng awo. <verse eid="ROM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23" />Awɛt ayɔng fɛ́ a bi iyɛ gak naton ikyɛng fɛ́ a tsin ya, a tsin kɔk ice wu ishɔt Adakunom, nek kuyak fɛ́ a se ne ku ni inɔɔk atsak awo. Nek ngma ikyɛng fi da i ni inɔɔk atsak awo, i yet inɛn.<verse eid="ROM 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15" />
  <para style="s">Tɛrɛk yin bafidang iyɛ, da ice yin awo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1" />Iyit fi in se yit gbagba ni inɔɔk atsak, i se gyat ni in sok yit kunanang bayɔng fɛ́ ba se buk-buk ni inɔɔk atsak, in bi sot yit bafi ishim ice yit awo. <verse eid="ROM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2" />Won kaangan ayɛt yit na a nye ikyɛng itɛrɛk iyɛ sak na afidang, na ban ku nok mo, inɔɔk atsak wu. <verse eid="ROM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3" />Nek Anet-Isheshek ice wu, da a kin sot nek ice wu awo, awɛt tɛ ba kin di jɛk ye, &lt;&lt;Itok bayɔng fɛ́ ba kin da tosong ingɔn, i mi bun naton hom.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4" />Nek ngma nkyɔrɔk yɔng fɛ́ ba man jɛk neme, ba kin jɛk ina nek ba ki tees yit mo, nɔng in di bin sot yit na anyɛk ni isot gbagba fi i ki nesek yit ite iyɛ.<verse eid="ROM 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5" />Won Adakunom fɛ́ a nesek anyɛk ni isot gbagba, na a ki nɔɔk yin kabik imoon ice ni irèn yɔng fɛ́ Anet-Isheshek aYeso ki tees yit mo. <verse eid="ROM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6" />Nɔng i di ki nɔɔk yin Adakunom, Ada aTisa yit aYeso Kristi ízɔk wu, ni iyɛ izining, na kanu kazining.<verse eid="ROM 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7" />Shashang yin bafidang ni mbɔk nfifaa, kyɔn tɛ fɛ́ Anet-Isheshek ki shan yin mo, nɔng ba bin di tere Adakunom. <verse eid="ROM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8" />Nek in shim in ki tak yin fok, aKristi sot anɛk baYahuda nɔng ba di ki tonong atsak ifɛ̀ Adakunom, nɔng ba di ki tonong ishining kushi fɛ́ ba man nye badakop bá ne, <verse eid="ROM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9" />nɔng Ícɛn-iduk di ki tere Adakunom nek angmishish wu. I se ni ijɛk fok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">&lt;&lt;Nek anɔng, imi bi da tere</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:9">nate Ícɛn-iduk;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">In bi ra abom itere iyerek ngɔn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10" />Ba tɛ ba fɛ̀ ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:10">&lt;&lt;Iyin, Ícɛn-iduk, nye yin ifeng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:10">na banet Adakunom.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11" />Ba tɛ ba fɛ̀ ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">&lt;&lt;Ngma Ícɛn-iduk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:11">tere yin aTisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">won banet ngma kusum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:11">ba ku tere.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12" />AIshaya kin fɛ̀ bà ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">&lt;&lt;Akak bi wuruk ni izɔrɔk aJesi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">ayɔng fɛ́ a bi dorok</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">nek iya igwɔm Icɛ́n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">ngma kusum;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">Ícɛn-iduk bi di te iyɛ ni wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13" />Won Adakunom fɛ́ a nesek ites iyɛ, na a shining ayɛ yin ni ifeng ni kusonong kukyang ni inɔɔk atsak fi i bɛ̀ yin ni wu, nɔng kukyem Kabik aJɛrɛ bin ki shining yin ni ite iyɛ.<verse eid="ROM 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">ABulus anet itomong Anet-Isheshek sak ni Ícɛn-iduk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14" />Ábaruneng, imi ice min, in rēn tsɛngtsɛng fok, iyin bɛ̀ yin nggɔn ntek, i bɛ̀ yin irēn makiyi fi i kyem ni i di tees yin bafidang. <verse eid="ROM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15" />Awɛt imi mi wuruk wɛshɛk in ki jɛk yin nkyɔrɔk nkak, nɔng in ki yiring yin ne, nek itek fi in mi sɛ na Adakunom, <verse eid="ROM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16" />nɔng ni in di sot anet itomong Anet-Isheshek aYeso sak ni Ícɛn-iduk. Ni in ra kutomong iware kufi ishara ifɛ̀ itek Adakunom, nɔng Ícɛn-iduk bi sot kunang inabak fɛ́ Adakunom shim, bayɔng fɛ́ Kabik aJɛrɛ mi kusu cɛ́l.<verse eid="ROM 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17" />Nek anɔng, in nye kukaa na Anet-Isheshek aYeso ayɛt kutomong fi in tsin ra Adakunom e. <verse eid="ROM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18" />Nek anɔng, in da shim in cɛɛt naton ikyi ikak awo, tit kutomong fɛ́ Anet-Isheshek mi ra ni bɔk hom. In mi kɔk Ícɛn-iduk kutaa, sak ni ifok ifɛ̀ Adakunom, ayɛt ikyɛng fi in fɛ̀ ni idɔng fi in nye, <verse eid="ROM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19" />ni irèn nkyɔrɔk ajingjing, ni kutomong ibes fɛ́ kukyem Kabik nye. In tumung e nkum aRushelima in tsin in gorok sak ni mben aIlirikum, in shara ifɛ̀ itek Anet-Isheshek kaakyɛ. <verse eid="ROM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20" />Ikyɛng fi in mi sok ni iyɛ hom yet fok, in da shara ifɛ̀ itek Anet-Isheshek na narɔ fɛ́ da ba mi ku rēn awo, kɔng in bi tsin in nok narɔ fɛ́ akak mi di ta itis. <verse eid="ROM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21" />Ke ane, tɛ ba kin di jɛk ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">&lt;&lt;Bayɔng fɛ́ ba man ka ba tak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:21">ikyikak naton wu awo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:21">ba bi di;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">na bayɔng fɛ́ ba man fok awo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:21">ba bi ku rēn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">ABulus se ni kuyiring i tse itsen na aRoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22" />Nkyɔrɔk fi in di ro ibɛ́ ni yin yɔng. <verse eid="ROM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23" />Awɛt yɔkɔnɔng fi kutomong hom mi gang abak ka kang, ayet fok in mi sok ayɛ dot in shim in bi in ki di yin, <verse eid="ROM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24" />in shim in bi got azɔng ni yin, ni irèn hom sak i tse na aSpaniya. In bi te iyɛ in bi got azɔng ni yin, ama fi in ra fɔn ni iyin nfi kizen gyeet, ni sɛ ni di tsa yin ni igbingding kutseet hom sak azɔng.<verse eid="ROM 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25" />Yɔkɔnɔng ana, in se ni irèn sak na aRushelima, in tsin nɔɔk bafi ikuus fɛ́ ba se azɔng ikyɛng fɛ́ ba tusung. <verse eid="ROM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26" />Nek bafi ikuus fɛ́ ba se na aMasedoniya nɛ bafɛ́ Akaya ba bi iyɛ ikan ayɛt itusung nkyɔrɔk nek igbingding bakan ayɛt bafi ikuus fɛ́ ba se na aRushelima. <verse eid="ROM 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27" />Ba bi iyɛ ikan ni inye anɔng, na atsak e, i se kpaf na ba nye anɔng e. Nek ki Ícɛn-iduk man sɛ kanu kafuba ayɛt nkyɔrɔk kabik fi in yet nfɛ́ baYahuda, i se gyat iba na ba kaba ngma nkyɔrɔk fɛ́ ba bɛ̀ gung na baYahuda. <verse eid="ROM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28" />Nek anɔng, ama fi in gang kutomong kang, in mi ka ba nabak ngma nkyɔrɔk yɔng fɛ́ ba tusung e, in da yit irèn sak na aSpaniya, in da wat in tabak azɔng in ki di yin ninyɛn. <verse eid="ROM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29" />Imi rēn fok ki in bin ta azɔng, in bi bin tik ni kushining nnang fɛ́ Anet-Isheshek nesek.<verse eid="ROM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30" />Ábaruneng, in tsin ra awon ni yin, ni iyerek aTisa yit aYeso Kristi ni ishim fɛ́ Kabik aJɛrɛ nesek, ni di sɛ yin mo na awon na Adakunom, nek igigashang fi in se ne. <verse eid="ROM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31" />Ra yin awon nek in di hwyet ni bɔk bafɛ́ avit inɔɔk atsak yɔng fɛ́ ba se na aJudiya, nɔng kutomong fi in da tsi in ra na aRushelima bin sɛ ishan na bafi ikuus fɛ́ ba se azɔng, <verse eid="ROM 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32" />nɔng ke Adakunom shim, ni in bin nɔ azɔng narɔ yin ni itɛrɛk iyɛ, ni in sɛ ifɔn azɔng nate yin. <verse eid="ROM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33" />Won Adakunom fɛ́ a nesek kusot kukyang, na a se gung ni iyin ngma. Anɔng.<verse eid="ROM 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16" />
  <para style="s">Ite ashow igang e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1" />In shim in ki tonong yin anganeng yit aFibi, anet itomong nate bafi ikuus fɛ́ ba se na aKɛnkɛrɛya. <verse eid="ROM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2" />Imi shim ni i ku shan ni irèn fɛ́ bafi ikuus di shashang bafidang. Ku nɔɔk yin kaakyi kuri igbingding fɛ́ a da tsɛt ni yin, nek iwu ice wu, a mi gbinding banet dot ngma ni imi.<verse eid="ROM 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3" />Di te show yin aPrisila nɛ Akwila, bafidang itomong hom na Anet-Isheshek aYeso. <verse eid="ROM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4" />Ba nɔɔk nwaa kutset bá nek imi. Imi azimin kyek awo, awɛt ngma ni ishɛrɛp bafi ikuus Ícɛn-iduk bi iyɛ ikan sak ni ba.<verse eid="ROM 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5" />Di te show bafi ikuus fɛ́ ba nyis ari bá.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 16:5">Di te show yin icɛk iyɛ hom aEfenitus, anet imɛsɛng fɛ́ a kin tun shan aKristi ni mben Asiya ngma kusum.<verse eid="ROM 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6" />Di te show yin aMarya, iwu fɛ́ a di ngu ice ni kutomong nek iyin.<verse eid="ROM 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7" />Di te show yin Andaronikus nɛ aJuniyas, bafi izit in fɛ́ ba kin se ari nyang gung ni imi. Iba fɛ́ ba mak ka ba rēn kaakɛ ayɛt batom-aYeso, iba kin tin shan aYeso aza min.<verse eid="ROM 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8" />Di te show yin icɛk iyɛ hom ayɛt aTisa, Amfiliyatus.<verse eid="ROM 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9" />Di te show yin aUrbanus, afidang itomong yit ayɛt Anet-Isheshek, ni icɛk iyɛ hom aSitakis.<verse eid="ROM 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10" />Di te show yin Afalis, anet fɛ́ ba mi ku mara, a nyeseng gak na Anet-Isheshek.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 16:10">Di te show yin bafɛ́ ari Aristobulus.<verse eid="ROM 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11" />Di te show yin aHirodiyɔn, afi izit hom.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="ROM 16:11">Di te show yin bafɛ́ ari aNasisus fɛ́ ba se ni ikuus aTisa.<verse eid="ROM 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12" />Di te show yin aTirayifina nɛ aTirayifusa, banyining fɛ́ ba di ngu ice ni kutomong aTisa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="ROM 16:12">Di te show yin icɛk iyɛ hom aPasis, azining ayɛt banyining fɛ́ ba di ngu ice ayɛt kutomong aTisa.<verse eid="ROM 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13" />Di te show yin aRufus, anet fɛ́ ba ku kasa ni kutomong aTisa. Ni ti di te show yin nggɔ wu, fɛ́ a di sok tɛ ari wu.<verse eid="ROM 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14" />Di te show yin Asinkritus nɛ aFiligon nɛ aHarmis nɛ aPaturobas nɛ aHarmas ni ishɛrɛp baruneng fɛ́ ba se gung ni iba.<verse eid="ROM 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15" />Di te show yin aFilologus nɛ aJuliya nɛ aNeriyus nɛ anganeng bá nɛ aOlimpas ni ishɛrɛp bafi ikuus fɛ́ ba se gung ni iba.<verse eid="ROM 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16" />Te show yin bafidang ni ite ngmak aJɛrɛ. Ngma bafi ikuus Anet-Isheshek tsin ki nye yin ashow.<verse eid="ROM 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itabak igang e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17" />Ábaruneng, in tsin ra awon ni yin, nye yin yɛɛt na bayɔng fɛ́ ba bɛ́s ni ikaba, na ba ki ro yin inye ikyɛng fɛ́ ba man ki tees yin. Nyeseng yin atsitse ni iba. <verse eid="ROM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18" />Nek kuri bayɔng tsin ra kutomong nek aTisa yit Anet-Isheshek awo, tit ifɛ́ nafa bá kyɛk. Ayɛt nta ncɛɛt bá ni itere mbɔɔs, ba di wɔrɔsɔ banet fɛ́ ba se vit itsɛ́ng. <verse eid="ROM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19" />Nek kaangan mi fok ifoos ifɛ̀ fi i bɛ̀ yin, nek anɔng, in bi ifeng nek iyin, awɛt imi shim ni i sot yin tsɛngtsɛng naton ikyɛng fi i yet itek, ni ma kusu yin mbɔk yin ni ikyɛng fi i yet imaan e.<verse eid="ROM 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20" />Adakunom fɛ́ a nesek kusot kukyang, ngmash na a fɛlɛ aShetan na atas atak yin.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:20">Won itek aTisa yit aYeso, i di nak gung ni iyin.<verse eid="ROM 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21" />Afidang itomong in aTimoti ki nye show yin; nɛ aLushiyos nɛ aJasɔn nɛ aSosipata bafi izit hom.<verse eid="ROM 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22" />Imi aTatiyus fi in jɛk kufumung kang, in tsin ki te show yin ayɛt aTisa yit.<verse eid="ROM 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23" />AGayus anet fi in tik ari wu, ayɔng fɛ́ bafi ikuus ngma nyis ari wu, tsin ki te show yin.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 16:23">Arastus, akɔk-ashon bafi itomong iwɔp nɛ aruneng yit aKwartus, ki nye show yin. <verse eid="ROM 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24" />Won itek aTisa yit aYeso Kristi ni i sot gung ni yin ngma. Anɔng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Afumung akak fɛ́ ba kin jɛk ina ni mbɔk afɛ́ ashon da a bi ibyat ifi </char><char style="fv">24</char> awo.</note><verse eid="ROM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">ABulus fam na awon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25" />Won ízɔk ni i sot ifɛ́ Adakunom, iwu fɛ́ a bɛ̀ kukyem a ki te tsik yin ayɛt inɔɔk atsak yin nek ifɛ̀ itek fi in shara naton aYeso Kristi. Ifɛ̀ itek e dɔng fi i tsang se ni nɛt na ayɛ ama, <verse eid="ROM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26" />awɛt yɔkɔnɔng, ba mi tun ide wɛshɛk ni ijɛk batan. Wat Adakunom vit nkum kin fɛ̀ na ba tonong ide ngma sak ni Icɛ́n azatse, nɔng ba bin di nɔɔk atsak na ba foos ifɛ̀ me. <verse eid="ROM 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27" />Won ízɔk ni i sot ifɛ́ Adakunom, iwu aziwu kyɛk fɛ́ a yet atsitsɛng, ayɛt aYeso Kristi ayɛ na ayɛ! Anɔng.<verse eid="ROM 16:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16" />
</usx>